<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mirandu ya shaka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha kwanja sha Mirandu ya Shaka</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Mirandu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mira</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mirandu ya shaka</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha 1 na sha 2 sha Mirandu ya shaka shiweriti shimuhera na shikulu. Shanjiti kubagulwa kuwera vitabu viwili palii Biblia ya shiebrania payanjiti kulembwa kwa Shiyunani na kushemwa Septuanta. Mana ya Mirandu ya shaka Shiebrania ndo, “Mirandu yayilawiriti mumashaka aga.” Wabetula wavuwa wajimira handa Ezra ndo yakalembiti na kujojonira shitabu sha 1 na sha 2 sha Mirandu ya shaka viraa vitabu vya Ezra na Nehemiya. Mlemba katendera vyanjiru vivuwa nentu muvitabu vya Samueli na Wafalumi, kulemba vitabu avi. Wabetula wavuwa wavimana handa vilembitwi shinja sha mhanu na nusu pamberi pa kwiwuka kwa Kristu, iwezekana kuwera shaka Ezra pakaweriti mkomu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha 1 na sha 2 sha Mirandu ya shaka shibagula vipinga vya wazewi kwanjira Adamu mpaka Ibrahimu na ntambu ya yanjiti isi ya wantu wa Israeli mpaka Waisraeli pawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu kwawatolitwi kuwera wamanda. Kwanjira shaka ashi Mirandu ya shaka shitakulira historia ya wantu wa Israeli kulawa kumalilira mirandu ya mfalumi Sauli mpaka mji gwa Yerusalemu paguhalibisiwitwi na wantu wa Babeli. Muvitabu avi vyoseri vya Mirandu ya shaka, mlemba katakulira nentu kuusu mirandu ya numba nkulu ya Mlungu aku Yerusalemu. Dawudi katanditi vintu vivuwa toziya ya kunyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu (1 Mirandu ya shaka 28-29) Na kulawa panu Selemani mwana gwa Dawudi ndo yakanyawiti (2 Mirandu ya shaka 2-7). Mlemba gwa Vitabu vya Mirandu ya shaka katakulira ntambu yayihalibisitwi numba nkulu ya Mlungu na vyombu vyakuyi ntambu yavitolitwi (2 Mirandu ya shaka 36:15-21). Upeleru wa msitari gwa shitabu sha 2 Mirandu ya shaka (36: 23) ilanguziya pota kufifa numba nkulu ya Mlungu ntambu hayinyawiwi kayi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweraamu mushitabu sha 1 sha Mirandu ya shaka:</para>
  <para style="io">Shitabu ashi shitakulira matawu goseri ga wantu kwanjira Adamu mpaka Waisraeli ntambu yawawuyiti kwawatolitwi umanda. Shipandi sha 1-9</para>
  <para style="io">Shitabu ashi shitakulira kuusu kulikali kwa Dawudi na ntambu yakakolitimlima aku Israeli. Shipandi sha 10-29</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Kulawa Adamu mpaka Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Lyanjiru 5:1-32</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10:1-32</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">11:10-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />Adamu kamwiwuliti Seti na Seti kamwiwuliti Enoki na Enoki kamwiwuliti Kenani. <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />Kenani kamwiwuliti Mahalaleli, Mahalaleli kamwiwuliti Yaredi, <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />Yaredi kamwiwuliti Henoki, Henoki kamwiwuliti Metusela, Metusela kamwiwuliti Lameki. <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />Lameki kamwiwuliti Nuhu, Nuhu kaweriti na wana watatu: Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />Wana wa Yafeti waweriti Gomeri na Magogu na Madai na Yavani na Tubali na Meshaki na Tirasi. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Wana wa Gomeri waweriti Ashekenazi na Rifati na Togama. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Wana wa Yavani waweriti Elisha na Tarishishi na Kitimu na Rodanimu. <verse eid="1CH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Wana wa Hamu waweriti Kushi na Misri, Puti na Kanaani. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Wana wa Kushi waweriti Seba na Havila na Sabita na Raama na Sabiteka, Wana wa Raama waweriti Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Kushi kamwiwuliti Nimrodi yakaweriti shikambaku gwa pasipanu. <verse eid="1CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" />Wiwuka wa Misri ndo Waludi na Waanamu na Walehabi na Wanafutuhi, <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />Wapaturusi na Wakasiluhi, Wakafitori weni awa ndo shanjiru sha Wafilisti. <verse eid="1CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Mwana gwa Kanaani kaweriti Sidoni, mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja na Heti, <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />Kanaani viraa kaweriti mbuyi gwa Wayebusi na Waamori na Wagirigashi, <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />Wahivi na Waariki na Wasini, <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />Waarivadi na Wasemali na Wahamati.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />Wana wa shemu waweriti Eramu na Ashuru na Arifakisadi na Ludi na Aramu na Usi na Huli na Geteri na Mashi. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Arifakisadi kamwiwula Shela na Shela kamwiwula Eberi. <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />Eberi kaweriti na wana wawili, yumu wamshemiti Pelegi. Litawu ali mana yakuyi kubaganika. Toziya shaka shakuyi wantu waweriti wabagalanika pasipanu na mlongu gwakuyi wamshemiti Yokitani. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Awu ndo wiwuka wa Yokitani waweriti Alimodadi na Shelefu na Hasalimaweti na Yera, <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />Hadoramu na Uzali na Dikila, <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />Obali na Abimaeli na Sheba, <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />Ofili na Havila na Yobabu. Wantu awa ndo wana wa Yokitani.<verse eid="1CH 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" />Kaya ya Abrahamu kulawira Shemu ndo alu. Shemu kawiwula Aripakisadi na Aripakisadi kamwiwula Shela. <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />Shela kamwiwula Eberi, Eberi kamwiwula Pelegi na Pelegi kamwiwula Rewu, <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />Rewu kamwiwula Serugi na Serugi kamwiwula Nahori na Nahori kamwiwula Tera, <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />Na Tera kamwiwula Abramu, shakapanu wamshemiti Abrahamu.<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Lyanjiru 25:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Abrahamu kaweriti na wana wawili wapalu, Isaka na Ishimaeli. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Avi ndo viyiwuku Vyawu. Mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Ishimaeli kaweriti Nebayoti na wamonga ndo Kedali na Adibeeli na Mibisamu, <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />Mishima na Duma na Masa na Hadadi na Tema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />Yetuli na Nafishi na Kedema. Awa ndo wana wa Ishimaeli.<verse eid="1CH 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />Abrahamu kaweriti na mdala mpusu yawamshemiti Ketula. Ketula kamwiwuliriti Abrahamu. Zimrani na Yokishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na shuwa. Wana wa Yokishani waweriti Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Wana wa Midiani waweriti. Efa na Eferi na Hanoki na Abida na Elidaa. Woseri awa waweriti wiwuka wa Ketura.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Esau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="GEN 36:1-19">Lyanjiru 36:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Isaka mwana gwa Abrahamu, kaweriti na wana wawili. Esawu na Yakobu shakapanu wamshemiti Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" />Wana wa Esawu waweriti Elifazi na Rehueli na Yeushi na Yalamu na Kora. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Wana wa Elifazi waweriti Temani na Omari na Sefo na Gatama na Kenazi. Timina kaweriti mdala gwakuyi mpusu gwa Elifazi na yomberi kamleriti mwana litawu lyakuyi Amaleki. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Wana wa Rehueli waweriti Nahati na Zera na Shama na Miza.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa kwanja yawalikaliti muisi ya Edomu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="GEN 36:20-30">Lyanjiru 36:20-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />Shanjiru sha wenikaya wa Edomu shiweriti wiwuka kulawa kwa wana wa Seiri ndo awa, Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana na Dishoni na Eseri na Dishani. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Wana wa Lotani waweriti wawili. Hori na Homamu. Na Lotani kaweriti na dada gwakuyi yawamshemiti Timna. <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Wana wa Shobali waweriti Alivani na Manahati na Ebali na Shefu na Onamu. Wana wa Sibeoni waweriti Aya na Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Mwana gwa Ana kaweriti Dishoni na wana wa Dishoni kaka gwakuyi Ana kaweriti Hamrani na Eshibani na Itirani na Kerani. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Wana wa Eseri waweriti Bilihani na Zaawani na Akani na wana wa Dishani waweriti Usi na Arani.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wafalumi wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="GEN 36:31-43">Lyanjiru 36:31-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />Awa ndo wafalumi yawakolitimlima isi ya Edomu pamberi kenekolimlima mfalumi yoseri gwa Waisraeli. Bela mwana gwa Beori kakolitimlima isi ya Edomu, pakawera na makawu gakuyi makulu mumji gwa Dinihaba. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Bela pakahowiti, Yobabu mwana gwa Zera kulawa Bosira kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Yobabu pakahowiti, Hushamu gwa isi ya Watemani kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Hushamu pakahowiti, Hadadi mwana gwa Bedadi kakolitimlima pa yomberi, makawu gakuyi pagawera mumji gwa Aviti. Ayu ndo yakawakomiti na kuwakanka Wamidiani muisi ya Mowabu. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Hadadi pakahowiti, Samla kulawa Masireka kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Samla pakahowiti, Shauli kulawa Rehoboti mji yaguweriti pakwegera na lushemba, kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Shauli pakahowiti, Baali Hanani mwana gwa Akiboli kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Baali Hanani pakahowiti, Hadadi kulawa Pai kakolitimlima pa yomberi na litawu lya mdala gwakuyi liweriti Mehetabeli, mhinga gwa Matiredi na mhinga gwa Mezahabu. <verse eid="1CH 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Hadadi viraa kahowa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:51">Wakulu wa makabila ga Edomu waweriti Timna na Aliva na Yeteti, <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />Oholibama na Ela na Pinoni, <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />Kenazi na Temani na Mibisari, <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />na Magidieli na Iramu. Awa ndo wakulu wa likabila lya Edomu.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Yakobu yawamshemiti Israel kaweriti na wana wapalu lilongu na mbili. Rubeni na Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakari na Zabuloni, <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />na Dani na Yosefu na Benjamini na Nafutali na Gadi na Asheri.<verse eid="1CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />Wana wa Yuda yawiwukiti na Beti Shuwa, mdala kulawa isi ya Kanani, waweriti Eri na Onani na Shela. Eri, mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Yuda, kaweriti mkontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, su Mtuwa Mlungu kamlaga. <verse eid="1CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" />Tamali nyahonga gwakuyi Yuda kamwiwuliliti wana wawili. Peresi na Zera, walanga ya wana wa Yuda waweriti wamhanu. <verse eid="1CH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Peresi kaweriti na wana wawili, Hesironi na Hamuli. <verse eid="1CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Zera mlongu gwakuyi kaweriti na wana wapalu wamhanu, Zimuri na Eteni na Hemani na Kalikoli na Dara. <verse eid="1CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" />Mwana gwa Karimi, kaweriti Akari, Akari mana yakuyi ntabiku. Ayu kawajegeriti wantu wa israeli ntabiku toziya kafifiti lopola zyaziweriti walumika. <verse eid="1CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Etani kaweriti na mwana mpalu yumu, litawu lyakuyi Azariya.<verse eid="1CH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaya ya Mfalumi Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Wana wapalu wa Hesiromu waweriti Yerameeli, Ramu na Karebu. <verse eid="1CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Ramu kamwiwula Aminadabu na Aminadabu kamwiwula Nashoni, mkulu gwa likabila la Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Nashoni kamwiwula Salimoni na Salimoni kamwiwula Boazi, <verse eid="1CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />Boazi kamwiwula Obedi na Obedi Kamwiwula Yese. <verse eid="1CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Yese kaweriti na wana wapalu saba, Eliyabu ndo mwana gwa kwanja na gwa pili Abinadabu na gwa tatu Shama, <verse eid="1CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />na gwa msheshi Netaneli na gwa mhanu Radai, <verse eid="1CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />gwa sita Osemu na gwa saba Dawudi. <verse eid="1CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />Wadada wawu waweriti Seruya na Abigaili. Wana wapalu wa Seruya waweriti watatu. Abishai na Yoabu na Asaheli. <verse eid="1CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Abigaili kaweriti mawu gwa Amasa mweni tati gwakuyi kaweriti Yeteri kulawa wiwuka wa Ishimaeli.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Hezironi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Karebu mwana gwa Hezironi, kaweriti na wadala wawili, Azuba na Yerioti. Na Azuba kamwiwuliriti wana wapalu watatu Yesheri na Shaobabu na Aridoni. <verse eid="1CH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Azuba pakahowiti, Karebu kamuyugiti Efrata yakamwiwuliliti mwana mpalu yawamshemiti Huri.<verse eid="1CH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Huri kamwiwula mwana mpalu yawamshemiti Uri na Uri kamwiwula mwana mpalu yawamshemiti Bazaleli.<verse eid="1CH 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Hesironi pakaweriti na vinja sitini, kamuyugiti muhinga gwa Makiri yakaweriti dada gwa Gileyadi. Ayu kamwiwuliliti mwana mpalu litawu lyakuyi Segubu. <verse eid="1CH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Segubu kamwiwuliliti mwana mpalu yawamshemiti Yairi mweni kakolitimlima miji mikulu ishilini na mitatu muisi ya Gileyadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />Kumbiti falumi za Geshuri na Aramu paziwakomangiti na kuwapoka miji ya Haroti Yairi, Kenati na vijiji vyakuyi, walanga ya miji sitini. Woseri awa waweriti wiwuka wa Makiri, tati gwakuyi Gileyadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Pa Hesironi kuhowa, mwana gwakuyi Karebu kamyugiti Efurati yakaweriti mkenja gwa tati gwakuyi. Efurati kamwiwuliliti Karebu mwana mpalu litawu lyakuyi Ashuru, yakaweriti mwanjisha gwa mji gwa Tekoa.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Yerameeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Yerameeli, mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Hesironi kaweriti na wana wapalu wamhanu. Ramu, mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja na Buna na Oreni na Osemu na Ahiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />Yerameeli kaweriti na mdala yumonga litawu lyakuyi Atara, Ayu kamwiwuliliti Yerameeli mwana mpalu, litawu lyakuyi Onamu. <verse eid="1CH 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Wana wa Ramu mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Yerameeli waweriti Maasi na Yamini na Ekeri. <verse eid="1CH 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Wana wapalu wa Onamu waweriti Shamai na Yada. Wana wapalu wa Shamai waweriti Nadabu na Abishuri.<verse eid="1CH 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Abishuri kayugiti mdala litawu lyakuyi Abihaili na yomberi kamwiwuliliti wana wapalu wawili, Abani na Molidi. <verse eid="1CH 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Wana wapalu wa Nadabu waweriti Seledi na Apaimu, kumbiti Seledi kahowiti pota kulera wana. <verse eid="1CH 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Apaimu kaweriti na mwana mpalu yumu yawamshemiti Ishi. Ishi kamwiwuliliti Sheshani na Sheshani kamwiwuliliti Alai.<verse eid="1CH 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Wana wapalu wa Yada, mlongu gwakuyi Shamai waweriti wawili. Yeteri na Yonatani, Yeteri kahowiti pota kulera wana. <verse eid="1CH 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Yonatani kaweriti na wana wawili, Peleti na Zaza. Woseri awa ndo wiwuka wa Yerameeli.<verse eid="1CH 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Sheshani kaheriti ndiri wana wapalu, ira wadala hera. Kumbiti kaweriti na mmanda mpalu gwa Shimisiri, litawu lyakuyi Yariha. <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Sheshani kamuyugiziya Yariha mmanda gwakuyi, yumu gwa wahinga wakuyi na yomberi kamwiwulira mwana litawu lyakuyi Atai. <verse eid="1CH 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Atai kamwiwuliti Natani na Natani kamwiwula Zabadi, <verse eid="1CH 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />Zabadi kamwiwula Efulali na Efulali kamwiwula Obedi, <verse eid="1CH 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />Obedi kamwiwula Yehu na Yehu kamwiwula Azariya, <verse eid="1CH 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />Azariya kamwiwula Helesi na Helesi kamwiwula Eleasa, <verse eid="1CH 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />Eleasa kamwiwula Sisimai na Sisimai kamwiwula Shalumu, <verse eid="1CH 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />Shalumu kamwiwula Yekamia na Yekamia kamwiwula Elishama.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wamonga wa Karebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Karebu, mlongu gwakuyi Yerameeli wamshemiti Mesha. Mesha kamwiwula Zifu na Zifu kamwiwula Maresha na Maresha kamwiwula Hebroni. <verse eid="1CH 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Hebroni kaweriti na wana wapalu wamsheshi, Kora na Tapua na Rekemu na Shema. <verse eid="1CH 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Shema kamwiwuliti Rahamu na Rahamu kamwiwuliti Yorikeamu, Rekemu kamwiwuliti Shamai, <verse eid="1CH 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />Shamai kamwiwuliti Maoni na Maoni kamwiwula Betisuri.<verse eid="1CH 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Karebu kaweriti na mdala mpusu litawu lyakuyi Efa. Ayu kamwiwuliliti wana wapalu watatu, Harani na Mosa na Gazezi. Harani viraa kamwiwuliti mwana mpalu yakamshemiti Gazezi.<verse eid="1CH 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />Wana wapalu wa Yadai waweriti sita, Regemu na Yotamu na Geshani na Peleti na Efa na Shaafu.<verse eid="1CH 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Karebu kaweriti na mdala mpusu yumonga litawu lyakuyi ndo Maaka. Ayu kamwiwuliliti wana wapalu wawili. Sheberi na Tirihana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />Maaka kamwiwuliliti wana wapalu wawili Karebu, Shaafu mwanjisha gwa mji gwa Madimana na Sheva, mwanjisha gwa mji gwa Makibena na Gibea. Karebu kaweriti viraa na mhinga, litawu lyakuyi Akisa.<verse eid="1CH 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Karebu kaweriti na wiwuka wamonga viraa kwa mdala gwakuyi Efurati. Huri mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja, ayu kaweriti na wana wapalu watatu. Shobali, mwanjishi gwa mji gwa Kiriyati Yearimu, <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />na gwa pili ndo Salima, myanzishi gwa mji gwa Betilehemu na gwa tatu Harefu, mwanjishi gwa mji gwa Beti Gaderi.<verse eid="1CH 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Shobali, mwanjishi gwa mji gwa Kiriyati Yealimu, kaweriti viraa mbuyi gwawu wantu wa Haroe na nusu ya wanalushi wa mji gwa Menuhoti, <verse eid="1CH 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />pamuhera na nkolu azi yazilikaliti Kiriyati Yearimu zeni ndo wantu wa Itiri na wantu wa Puti na wantu wa Shumati na wantu wa Mishirai. Wantu wa Sorati na wantu wa Eshitaoli walawiraniti na wantu awa.<verse eid="1CH 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Salima mwanjishi gwa mji gwa Betilehemu kaweriti mbuyi gwa wantu wa Netofati na wantu wa Atiroti Beti Yoabu na nusu ya wantu wa Menahati yawaweriti Wasori,<verse eid="1CH 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />azi ndo nkolu za walemba yazilikaliti mumji gwa Yabesi, wantu wa Tirati na wantu wa Shimeyati na wantu wa Sukati. Awa ndo Wakeni yawalawiti muwiwuka wa Hamati, yakaweriti myanzishi gwa mji gwa Betirekabu.<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Wana wa Mfalumi Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />Awa ndo wana wa Mfalumi Dawudi yawiwukiti shaka pakaweriti aku Hebroni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:1">Amnoni mwiwuka gwakuyi kwanja, mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Ahinoamu kulawa Yezireeli,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:1">gwa pili Danieli mweni mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Abigaili kulawa Karimeli, <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />Gwa tatu kaweriti Abusalomu, mweni mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Maaka mhinga gwa Talimai Mfalumi gwa Geshuri na gwa msheshi Adoniya mweni mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Hagiti, <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />gwa mhanu kaweriti Shefatiya mweni mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Abitali, gwa sita kaweriti Itireamu, mweni mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Egila.<verse eid="1CH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" />Awa sita, wiwukiti aku Hebroni kweni Dawudi kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja saba na nusu. Aku Yerusalemu kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja selasini na tatu, <verse eid="1CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" />na awa ndo wana wa mfalumi Dawudi pakaweriti Yerusalemu. Mdala gwakuyi Batisheba, mhinga gwa Amieli, kamwiwuliliti wana wapalu wamsheshi, Shimea na Shobabu na Natani na Selemani. <verse eid="1CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />Kuweriti na wana wamonga tisa. Ibihari na Elishuwa na Elipeleti, <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />Noga na Nefegi na Yafia, <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />Elishama na Eliyada na Elifeleti. <verse eid="1CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Woseri awa waweriti wana wapalu wa Dawudi, kutali na walii wamonga yawiwukiti kwa wadala wakuyi wapusu. Dawudi viraa kaweriti na mhinga, yamshemiti Tamali.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa mfalumi Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Awu ndo wiwuka wa mfalumi Selemani: Selemani kamwiwuliti Rehobowamu na Rehobowamu kamwiwuliti Abiya na Abiya kamwiwuliti Asa na Asa kamwiwuliti Yehoshafati, <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />Yehoshafati kamwiwuliti Yehoramu na Yehoramu kamwiwuliti Ahazia na Ahazia kamwiwuliti Yoashi, <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />Yoashi kamwiwuliti Amazia na Amazia kamwiwuliti Uziya na Uziya kamwiwuliti Yotamu, <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />Yotamu kamwiwuliti Ahazi na Ahazi kamwiwuliti Hezekia na Hezekia kamwiwuliti Manasi. <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />Na Manasi kamwiwuliti Amoni na Amoni kamwiwuliti Yosia. <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Yosia kaweriti na wana wapalu wamsheshi. Yohanani mwiwuka gwakuyi kwa kwanja, gwa pili ndo Yehoyakimu, gwa tatu ndo Sedekia na gwa msheshi ndo Shalumu mweni litawu lwakuwi limonga wamshemiti Yowahazi. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Yehoyakimu kaweriti na wana wapalu wawili, Yehoyakini viraa wamshemiti Yekoniya na Sedekia.<verse eid="1CH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa mfalumi Yehoyakini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Wana wapalu wa Yehoyakini yawatolitwi lopola na Wababuloni waweriti saba, Shealitieli, <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />Malikiramu na Pedaya na Shenazari na Yekamia na Hoshama na Nedabia. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Wana wapalu wa Pedaya waweriti, Zerubabeli na Shimei, Zerubabeli kaweriti na wana wapalu wawili, Meshulamu na Hanania na viraa Zerubabeli kaweriti na mhinga yumu, litawu lyakuyi Shelomiti. <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />Zerubabeli viraa kaweriti na wana wapalu wamonga mhanu, weni ndo Hashuba na Oheli na Berekia na Hasadia na Yushabi Hesedi.<verse eid="1CH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Wana wapalu wawili wa Hanania waweriti Pelatia na Yeshaya, Yeshaya kamwiwuliti Refaya na Refaya kamwiwuliti Arinani na Arinani kamwiwuliti Obadia na Obadia kamwiwuliti Shekania. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Shekania kamwiwuliti Shemaya, Wana wapalu wa Shemaya waweriti wamhanu, Hatushi na Igali na Baria na Nearia na Shafati. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Wana wapalu wa Neariya waweriti watatu, Eliehonayi na Hizikia na Azirikamu. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Eliehonayi kaweriti na wana wapalu saba, Hodaviya na Eliyashibu na Pelaya na Akubu na Yohanani na Delaya na Anani.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />Awu ndo wamu wa wiwuka wa Yuda waweriti Peresi na Hesironi na Karimi na Huri na Shobali. <verse eid="1CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Reaya mwana gwa Shobali, kamwiwula Yahati, yakaweriti tati gwakuyi Ahumayi na Lahadi, azi ndo nkolu za wantu wa Sorati. <verse eid="1CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Wana wapalu wa Etamu waweriti Yezireeli, Ishima na Idibashi, Waweriti na dada gwawu yumu wamshemiti Haseleliponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />Penueli kaweriti mwanjisha gwa mji gwa Gedori, Ezeri kaweriti mwanjirishi gwa mji gwa Husha, Awa waweriti wiwuka wa Huri mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Efrata, Huri mwanjisha gwa mji gwa Betilehemu.<verse eid="1CH 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Ashuru, mwanjishi gwa mji gwa Tekowa, kaweriti na wadala wawili, awa ndo Hela na Naara. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Naara kawiwulira wana wapalu wamsheshi, Ahuzamu na Heferi na Temeni na Haahashitari. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Hela kamwiwulira wana wapalu watatu, Sereti na Ishari na Etinani. <verse eid="1CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />Hakosi kamwiwula Anubi na Sobeba na ndo yakaweriti tati gwa nkolu za wiwuka wa Ahariheli, mwana mpalu gwa Harumu.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Kwaniti muntu yumu litawu lyakuyi Yabesi, yakapananitwi ligoya kuliku walongu wakuyi woseri. Mawu gwakuyi kamshemiti Yabesi pakalonga, “Nimwiwuliti kwa kutama.” <verse eid="1CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Yabesi kamluwa Mlungu gwa Israeli pakalonga, “Gwee Mlungu nikuluwa guntekeleri na kunongelera mpaka zyangu. Liwoku lyaku liweri pamuhera na neni na gundoleli kulawirana mlandu goseri gudoda, nantenda” Na Mlungu kampanana galii ganduwiti.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matawu ga Kaya zyamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Karebu mlongu gwa Shuha, kamwiwula Mehiri na Mehiri kamwiwula Eshitoni. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Eshitoni kaweriti na wana wapalu watatu. Beti Rafa na Pasea na Tehina. Tehina kaweriti tati gwa Iri Nahashi. Wiwuka wa wantu wa Reka.<verse eid="1CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Wana wapalu wa Kenazi waweriti Otinieli na Seraya viraa Otinieli kaweriti na wana wapalu wawili Hatati. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Meonotai kamwiwula Ofura. Seraya kamwiwula Yoabu, mwanjirishi gwa mji gwa Lulalanda lwa Mafundi. Kalipananiti litawu ali toziya wantu yawalikaliti amu waweriti mafundi yawavimana nentu.<verse eid="1CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Karebu mwana mpalu gwa Yefune kaweriti na wana wapalu watatu, Weni ndo Iru na Ela na Naamu, Na mwana gwa Ela kaweriti Kenazi.<verse eid="1CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Wana wapalu wa Yehaleleli waweriti wamsheshi, Zifu na Zifa na Tiria na Asareli.<verse eid="1CH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17" />Wana wapalu wa Ezira waweriti Yeteri, Meredi na Eferi na Yaloni. Meledi kamyugiti Bitia, mhinga gwa Farao na awa ndo wana wakamwiwuliliti Meredi, mhinga yumu litawu lyakuyi Miriamu na wantemba wawili Shamai na Ishiba na Ishiba mwanjishi gwa mji gwa Eshitemoa. <verse eid="1CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18" />Meredi kaweriti na mdala yumonga Myahudi. Mweni kamwiwuliliti Yeredi, mwanjilishi gwa mji gwa Gedori, Heberi mwanjilishi gwa mji gwa Soko na Yekutieli kaweriti mwanjilishi gwa mji gwa Zanoa.<verse eid="1CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Hodia kamyugiti dada gwa Nahamu mweni wiwuka wakuyi ndo wanjishi wa likabila lya Garimi, lyalilikaliti mumji gwa Keila na lukolu lwa Maakati, lwalulikaliti kumji gwa Eshitemoa.<verse eid="1CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Wana wapalu wamsheshi wa Shimoni waweriti Amunoni na Rina na Beni Hanani na Tiloni, Ishi kaweriti na wana wapalu wawili Zoheti na Beni Zoheti.<verse eid="1CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Shela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21" />Shela kaweriti yumu gwa wana wa Yuda kaweriti na mwana wapalu, Eri kaweriti mwanjisha gwa Leka na Laada ni mwanjisha gwa Maresha weni nkolu zawu ziweriti zyawasona nguwu nfufu ziherepa na yawalikaliti Beti Ashibea, <verse eid="1CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22" />Yokimu na wantu yawalikaliti kumji gwa Kozeba na Yoashi na Sarafi yawakolitimlima aku Mowabu na Lehemu.Visoweru avi vyamakashu nentu. <verse eid="1CH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />Awa ndo yawakuluga viwiga walikaliti aku Netaimu na Gedera pawamtendera mfalumi.<verse eid="1CH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Simiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Simiyoni kaweriti na wana wapalu wamhanu, Nemueli na Yamini na Yaribu na Zera na Shauli. <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />Shauli kamwiwula Shalumu na Shalumu kamwiwula Mibisamu na Mibisamu kamwiwula Mishima. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Wiwuka wa Mishima uweriti Hamueli na Hamueli kamlera Zakuri na Zakuri kamlera Shimei. <verse eid="1CH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Shimei kaweriti na wana wapalu kumi na sita. Na wahinga sita, kumbiti walongu wakuyi waheriti wana wavuwa hangu lukolu lwawu loseri lwaheriti wantu wavuwa handa likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28" />Miji yawalikaliti iweriti Beeri Sheba na Molada na Hazari Shuali, <verse eid="1CH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29" />Biliha na Ezemu na Toladi, <verse eid="1CH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30" />Betueli na Horima na Sikilagi, <verse eid="1CH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31" />Beti Marikaboti na Hazari Susimu na Beti Biri na Shaaraimu. Womberi walikaliti mu miji ayi mpaka shaka sha ukolitimlima mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="1CH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />Vijiji vyayiyizyengetiti viweriti Etamu na Aini na Rimoni na Tokeni na Ashani. <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />Pamuhera na vijiji vya kumbwega mwa mji gwa Baalati. Aga gaweriti makawu gawu na wagatuliti maholu ga nkolu zawu.<verse eid="1CH 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Wantu awa waweriti wakulu wa nkolu zawu: Meshobabu na Yamleki na Yosha kaweriti mwana mpalu gwa Amazia, <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />Yoweli na Yehu waweriti wana wa Yoshibiya na Yoshibiya kaweriti mwana gwa Seraya na Seraya kaweriti mwana gwa Asieli. <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />Vilaa Eliehonai na Yaakoba na Yeshohaya na Asaya na Adieli na Yesimieli na Benaya,<verse eid="1CH 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />Ziza kaweriti mwana gwa Shifi na Shifi kaweri mwana gwa Aloni na Aloni kaweriti mwana gwa Yedaya na Yedaya kaweriti mwana gwa Shimri na Shimri kaweriti mwana gwa Shemaya <verse eid="1CH 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />Walongu wawu wendereya kongereka nentu, <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />walipalasiya mpaka kuligomi lya mji gwa Gedori na uwega gwa gulawa mshenji gwa kululalanda, su kuwasakulila kondolu wawu maliwuziwu. <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />Aku wapatiti maliwuziwu gaherepa nentu na viraa isi yayiweriti na seemu nkulu na ponga na nyamaliru. Na Wahamu wamonga walikaliti aku makashu.<verse eid="1CH 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" />Mushaka sha Mfalumi Hezekia gwa Yuda, wantu awa yawakantitwi matawu gawu wagenditi Gedori na kuhalibisiya malingu ga Wameuni yawaweriti walikara aku na kuwawinga nakamu mpaka leru. Watenditi makawu gwawu ga mashaka goseri aku toziya kuweriti na maliwuziwu gavuwa toziya ya wankondolu wawu. <verse eid="1CH 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Wantu wamonga wa likabila la Simiyoni waweriti miya mhanu, wagenditi mpaka kulugongu Seiri. Pawalonguziwa na wana wa Ishi weni ndo Pelatia na Nearia na Refaya na Uzieli. <verse eid="1CH 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" />Wantu wa Simiyoni wawalagiti wantu wa Maleki yawasigaliti pa kuponeka na womberi walikala aku mpaka leru.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Rubeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />Rubeni kaweriti mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Israeli. Tembera Rubeni kaweriti mwiwuka gwa kwanja kafiruwitwi kupananwa uhala wa wiwuka gwa kwanja kumbiti kapananitwi Yusufu mlongu gwakuyi, toziya Rubeni kagonjiti na mdala gwa kunja gwa tati gwakuyi yakamtenditi kuwera mdala. Hangu yomberi kapananitwi ndiri seemu ya mwiwuka gwa kwanja. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" />Tembera Yuda ndo yakaziti kuwera kana makakala nentu pakati pa walongu wakuyi na mkolamlima kalawiti amu na seemu ya mwiwuka gwa kwanja iweriti ya Yusufu. <verse eid="1CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />Wana wa Rubeni mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Israeli waweriti, Henoki na Palu na Hesironi na Karimi.<verse eid="1CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />Wiwuka wa Yoeli kulawa wiwuka mpaka wiwuka waweriti: Shemaya na Gogi na Shimei, <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5" />na Mika na Reaya na Baali na Beeri. <verse eid="1CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6" />Na Beera yakaweriti mlonguziya gwa likabila lya Rubeni, ndo yakabatitwi na Tigilati Pileseri mfalumi gwa Ashuru na kumjega kugenda muuhamisiwu.<verse eid="1CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7" />Awa ndo wakulu wa nkolu yawalembitwi muwalanga ya maholu ga likabila lya Rubeni ndo: Yeieli na Zakaria, <verse eid="1CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8" />na Bela mwana gwa Azazi mzukulu gwa Shema, gwa lukolu lwa Yoeli. Lwalulikaliti mumji gwa Aroeri na mulienewu lyoseri lya kushana mpaka Bela na Baali Meoni. <verse eid="1CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />Toziya wamifugu wawu yongereka iwera ivuwa nentu, wantu walipalasiyiti uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mpaka kumayingiliwu ga shiwala yalieneyiti mpaka lushemba Eufrate.<verse eid="1CH 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Mumashaka ga Mfalumi Sauli, likabila lya Rubeni walikomanga na Wahajiri, wawalagiti munkondu na watoliti isi ya kwagulawa mushenji mwa Gileadi, walikala amu.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Likabila lya Gadi lipakaniti na likabila lya Rubeni uwega wa kushana, muisi ya Bashani yayieneyiti kwagulawa mshenji mpaka mumji gwa Saleka. <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />Yoeli ndo yakaweriti mkulu gwa lukolu lwaluweriti na makakala, gwa pili kaweriti Shafamu. Yanai na Shefati waweriti wakulu wa nkolu zimonga aku Bashani. <verse eid="1CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />Walongu wawu kulinganira na nkolu waweriti saba. Mikaeli na Meshulamu na Sheba na Yorai na Yakani na Zia na Eberi. <verse eid="1CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Woseri awa waweriti wiwuka wa Abihaili. Huri na Yaroa na Gileadi na Maiku na Yeshishai na Yado na Buzi. <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />Ahi, yakaweriti mwana gwa Abidieli na mzukulu gwa Guni, Ahi ndo yakaweriti mkulu gwa nkolu azi. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />Walikaliti museemu za Gileyadi, museemu ya Bashani na vijiji vyavizyengeta Sharoni, mpaka mumpaka. <verse eid="1CH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />Matawu ga wantu awa woseri galembilitwi munkolu, mumashaka ga Yotamu, mfalumi gwa Yuda na Yerobowamu mfalumi gwa pili gwa Israeli.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamashonta wa makabila ga kwagulawa mshenji.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Makabila ga Rubeni, Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi ga kwagulawa mshenji, gaweriti na mashonta wagagamala elufu arubaini na msheshi miya saba sitini, yawamana kutendera ngawu na ligumba, yawavimana nentu kunika upindi munkondu. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />Walikomiti nkondu na likabila lya Hagiti na Wayeturi na Wanafishi na Wanodabu. <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />Watuliti litumbiru lyawu kwa Mlungu na wamluwiti kawatangi na Mlungu kawawankuliti shawamluwiti na wawakanka Wahajiri pamuhera na waganja wawu. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />Walopoliti ngamiya elufu amusini, kondolu laki mbili na amusini elufu punda elufu mbili na walopola wantu laki yimu. <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />Walagiti wankondu wavuwa nentu toziya Mlungu kawatangiti. Na wendereyiti kulikala muisi ayi mpaka pawagenditi muuhamiziwu.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nusu ya wantu wa likabila la Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />Nusu ya wantu wa likabila la Manasi walikaliti muisi ya Bashani. Walanga yawu yongeleketi nentu na walipalasiya wega za kushana mpaka Baali Herimoni, Seniri na lugongu Herimoni. <verse eid="1CH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />Awa ndo yawaweriti wakulu wa nkolu za kabila ali. Eferi na Ishi na Elieli na Azirieli na Yeremiya na Hodaviya na Yadieli. Woseri waweriti wamashonta wagangamala na walonguziya munkolu azi.<verse eid="1CH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila ga kwagulawa mshenji gankujegerwa muuhamisiwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Kumbiti wantu walii wamgalambukiti Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu na kuguwira wamlungu wa wenikaya wa isi azi zyeni Mlungu kazangamiziyiti kulongolu kwawu. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" />Su Mlungu gwa Israeli kamtenda Pulu, mfalumi gwa Ashuru, mweni viraa kamanika handa Tigilati Pileseri, kayikankali isi yawu na kuwalopola Wareubeni, Wagadi na nusu ya likabila la Manase kwagulawa mshenji kawajegera mpaka mkuhamira aku Hala, Habori na Hara, kumpeku kulushemba Gozani, kweni aku walikala mpaka leru.<verse eid="1CH 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Lukolu lwa watambika wakulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />Lawi kaweriti na wana watatu. Gerishoni na Kohati na Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Kohati kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Amramu na Ishari na Hebroni na Uzieli. <verse eid="1CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Amuramu kaweriti na wana awa. Aruni na Musa na Miriamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:3">Aruni kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Nadabu na Abihu na Eliyazari na Itamari.<verse eid="1CH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Wiwuka wa Eleazari uweriti hangu: Finehasi na Finehasi Abishua, <verse eid="1CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />Abishua kamwiwula Buki na Buki kamwiwula Uzi, <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />Uzi kamwiwula Zerahiya na Zerahiya kamwiwula Merayoti, <verse eid="1CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />Merayoti kamwiwula Amariya na Amariya kamwiwula Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />Ahitubu kamwiwula Sadoki na Sadoki kamwiwula Ahimaasi, <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />Ahimaasi kamwiwula Azaria na Azaria kamwiwula Yohanani, <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />Azariya ndo yakatenditi lihengu lya utambika munumba nkulu ya Mlungu yakalinyawiti Mfalumi Selemani aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />Azaria kamwiwula Amaria, Amaria kamwiwula Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />Ahitubu kamwiwula Sadoki na Sadoki kamwiwula Meshulamu, <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />Meshulamu kamwiwula Hilikia na Hilikia kamwiwula Azaria, <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />Na Azaria kamwiwula Sereya na Sereya kamwiwula Yehosadaki, <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />Yehosadaki kajegitwi viraa mluhamira shaka Mtuwa Mlungu pakawajegeriti mluhamira wantu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu, kwa kumtendera mfalumi Nebukadineza.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wamonga wa Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />Lawi kaweriti na wana watatu. Geshoni na Kohati na Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Kila yumu gwawu kaweriti na wana wapalu. Gerishoni na Libini na Shimei. <verse eid="1CH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />Kohati kawiwuliti Amramu na Ishari na Hebroni na Uzieli. <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />Na Merari kawiwuliti, Mahili na Mushi. Awa ndo walongu wa Walawi kulinganira na nkolu zawu. <verse eid="1CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />Na wiwuka wa Gerishomu kulawa shiyiwuku kwa shiyiwuku waweriti. Libini na Yahati na Zima na <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />Yoa na Ido na Zera na Yeaterai.<verse eid="1CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />Na kulawa wiwuka wa Kohati shiyiwuku kwa shiyiwuku ndo awa. Aminadabu na Kora na Asiri, <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />Elikana na Ebiasafu na Asiri, <verse eid="1CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />Tahati na Urieli na Usiya na Shauli. <verse eid="1CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />Wana wa Elikana waweriti wawili, Amasai na Ahimoti.<verse eid="1CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />Na awa ndo wiwuka wa Ahimoti. Elikana na Sofai na Nahati, <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />Eliabu na Yerohamu na Elikana. <verse eid="1CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />Na wana wa Samueli waweriti wawili. Yoweli na Abiya.<verse eid="1CH 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Kulawa wiwuka wa Merari kulawa shiyiwuku mpaka shiyiwuku waweriti. Mahili na Mali na Libini na Shimeyi na Uza na <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />Shimeya na Hagiya na Asaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wimba wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />Awa ndo wantu weni Mfalumi Dawudi kawatuliti walonguziyi wimba munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu pa lisandiku lya lipatanu kutulwa mngati. <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />Watenditi lihengu lyawu lya kwimba kwa kwankana kulongolu kuliringu linanagala lya kuliwona, mpaka Mfalumi Sulemani pakanyawiti numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu aku Yerusalemu. Watenditi mahengu gawu teratera kwa vipindi. <verse eid="1CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />Kulawa lukolu lwa Kohati. Hemani mwana gwa Yoweri ndo yakaweriti mlonguziya gwa shipinga sha kwanja sha wimbaji. Lukolu lwakuyi kulawirana na Israeli ndo handa alu. Hemani na Yoweli na Samueli na <verse eid="1CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />Elikana na Yerohamu na Elieli na Towa na <verse eid="1CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />Zufu na Elikana na Mahati na Amasai na <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />Elikana na Yoweli na Azariya na Sefaniya na <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />Tahati na Asiri na Ebiasafu na Kora na <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />Ishari na Kohati na Lawi na Israeli,<verse eid="1CH 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />Asafu, ndo yakaweriti mlonguziya gwa pili gwa wimbaji. Gwakuyi kaweriti uwega wakuyi wa kumliwu. Lukolu lwakuyi kulawirana na Lawi. Asafu, mwana gwa Bereki, mwana gwa Shimeya, <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />mwana gwa Mikaeli na mwana gwa Baaseya na mwana gwa Malikiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />mwana gwa Etini, mwana gwa Zera na mwana gwa Adaya, <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />mwana gwa Etani na mwana gwa Zima na mwana gwa Shimei, <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />mwana gwa Yahati na mwana gwa Gerishoni mwana gwa Lawi. <verse eid="1CH 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />Etamu gwa lukolu lwa Merari ndo kaweriti mlonguziya gwa shipinga sha tatu sha yawimba. Lukolu lwakuyi kulawirana na Lawi ndo handa hangu. Etani mwana gwa Kishi na Abidi na Maluki. <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />Hashabia na Amazia na Hilikiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />Amsi na Bani na Shemeri, <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />Mahili na Mushi na Merari na Lawi. <verse eid="1CH 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />Walawi wamonga wapananwa mahengu gamonga ga kutenda munumba inanagala ya Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Aruni na wiwuka wakuyi ndo yawaweriti wankulaviya tambiku mushitalawanda sha tambiku za kulunguziwa na mushitawalanda sha kutumiziya ubani. Watenditi mahengu goseri ga pahala pananagala nentu su Mlungu kawalekeziyi Israeli vidoda vyawu. Goseri aga wagatenditi kulinganira na malagalira gakalaviyiti Musa ntumintumi gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />Awa ndo wiwuka wa Aruni. Eleazari na Finehasi na Abishuwa, <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />Buki na Uzi na Serahia, <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />Serahia na Merayoti na Amariya na Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />na Sadoki na Ahimaasi.<verse eid="1CH 6:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pahala pawalikaliti Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />Aga ndo makawu gawapananitwi wiwuka wa Aruni wa lukolu lwa Kohati na womberi ndo waweriti wa kwanja muisi yawapananitwi walawi. <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />Hawa wapananitwi mji gwa Hebroni muisi ya Yuda na maliwuziwu yagazyengeta. <verse eid="1CH 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" />Kumbiti malambu ga vijiji vyavizyengeta kapananwa Karebu mwana gwa Yefuni. <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" />Wiwuka wa Aruni wapananitwi miji ya kutugira. Hebroni na Libina pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi, Yatiri na Eshitemoa pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />Hileni na Debiri pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />Ashani na Beti Shemeshi pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />Kulawa pahala pa Benjamini wapananitwi miji ya Geba na Alemeti na Anatoti pamuhera na maliwuziwu ga miji ayi. Miji yoseri wapananitwi kulinganira na nkolu zawu lilongu na mitatu. <verse eid="1CH 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />Miji lilongu ya pahala pa nusu ya likabila lya Manasi lyaliweriti uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji ilaviwitwi kwa seemu yayisigaliti ya lukolu lwa Kohati kwa simbi kulinganira na nkolu zawu. <verse eid="1CH 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />Wiwuka wa Gerishoni lukolu kwa lukolu wapananitwi miji lilongu na mitatu mulikabila lya Isakari na Nafutali na Manasi wa kwagulawa mshenji muisi ya bashani. <verse eid="1CH 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" />Wiwuka wa Merari kulawa nkolu kwa nkolu,wapanwanitwi miji lilongu na miwili mulikabila lya Rubeni na Gadi na Zebuluni. <verse eid="1CH 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" />Hangu wantu wa Israeli wawapananiti Walawi miji ayi, su walikali amu pamuhera na maliwuziwu yagazyengetiti miji ayi. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />Miji yayikanditwi muisi ya likabila lya Yuda na Simiyoni na Benjamini vilavilii ibagulilitwi likabila lya lawi kwa simbi. <verse eid="1CH 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />Kaya zimonga za lukolu lwa wantu wa Kohati wapananitwi miji pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi muisi ya likabila lya Efraimu <verse eid="1CH 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67" />Mu Shekemu mji gwa kutugira muisi ya vigongu vya Efraimu na Gezeri na, <verse eid="1CH 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68" />Yokimeamu na Beti Horoni, <verse eid="1CH 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69" />Aiyaloni na Gati Rimoni. <verse eid="1CH 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70" />Munusu ya likabila lya Manasi wapananitwi miji Aneri pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi na Bileamu pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71" />Wagerishoni wapananitwi miji ayi pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi. Munusu ya likabira lya Manase yawaweriti uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji wapananitwi Golani Mubashani pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi, Ashitaroti pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72" />Mu pahala pa likabira lya Isakari wapananitwi. Kedeshi na Daberati na maliwuziwu gakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:73" />Ramoti na Anemu na maliwuziwu gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74" />Mulikabila lya Asheri wapananitwi. Mashali na Abudoni, <verse eid="1CH 6:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:75" />Hukoki na Rehobu na maliwuziwu gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76" />Mulikabila lya Nafutali. Kadeshi mu Galilaya na Hamoni pamuhera na Kiriyatiaimu pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77" />Wamerari yawasigaliti, wapananitwi miji ayi pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi yagazyengeta miji ayi. Mulikabila lya Zebuluni wapananitwi mji gwa Rimono na Tabori na maliwuziwu gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78" />Mulikabila lya Rubeni, kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani pakwegera na mji gwa Yeriku wapananitwi Bezeri yaguwera pahala pampindi pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi, Yahasa pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:79" />Kedemoti na Mefaati pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80" />Mulikabira lya Gadi wapananitwi Ramoti mu Gileyadi na Mahanaimu pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:81" />Heshiboni pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi na Yezeri pamuhera na maliwuziwu gakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 6:81" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Isakari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Isakari kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Tola na Pua na Yashubu na Shimuroni, <verse eid="1CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Wana wa Tola waweriti Uzi na Refaya na Yehieli na Yahamai na Ibusamu na Shemueli. Awa waweriti wakulu wa kaya za nkolu za Tola na wantu wagangamala nentu wa nkondu shaka shawu. Walanga ya wiwuka wawu mashaka ga mafalumi Dawudi iweriti ishilini na mbili elufu na miya sita. <verse eid="1CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Mwana gwa Uzi kaweriti na mwana yumu, litawu lyakuyi Izirahia. Na wana wa Izirahia waweriti Mikaeli na Obadiya na Yoweli na Ishiya. Woseri wamsheshi, waweriti wakulu mukaya. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Toziya ya wadala na wana wawu waweriti wavuwa nentu, kuweriti na vipinga vya wamashonta selasini na sita elufu, kulawirana na wiwuka wawu.<verse eid="1CH 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Walongu wawu mukaya zawu zoseri za kabila la Isakari yawaweriti na uwezu wa kulikomanga nkondu, ntambu yayilelembitwi mulukolu lwawu, woseri waweriti semanini na saba elufu.<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Benjamini na Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />Wana wa Benjamini waweriti watatu. Bela na Bekeri na Yediaeli. <verse eid="1CH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Wana wa Bela waweriti wamhanu. Esiboni na Uzi na Uzieli na Yerimoti na Iri. Awa waweriti walonguziya wa kaya zawu na wamashonta wagangamala. Yawalembitwi kwa kufata nkolu, walanga ya wamashonta woseri waweriti elufu ishilini na mbili na selasini na msheshi.<verse eid="1CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Wana wa Bekeri waweriti. Zemira na Yowashi na Eliezeri na Elieonai na Omri na Yerimoti na Abiya na Anatoti na Alemeti. Woseri awa ndo wiwuka wa Bekeri. <verse eid="1CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />Walembitwi kwa nkolu kulinganira na viyiwuku vyawu handa walonguziya wa kaya zawu na walanga za wiwuka wawu uweriti ishilini elufu miya mbili, woseri pawawera wagangamala wa nkondu.<verse eid="1CH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Yadiaeli kaweriti na mwana yumu, litawu lyakuyi Bilihani na Bilihani kaweriti na wana. Yewushi na Benjamini na Ehudi na Kenaana na Zetani na Tarishishi na Ahishahari. <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Woseri awa waweriti wakulu wa kaya munkolu zawu na lishonta ligangamala lya nkondu. Kulawirana na wiwuka wawu, kuweriti wapalu lilongu na saba elufu na miya mbili, wamashonta wagangamala kala nakamu kwa nkondu. <verse eid="1CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Shupimu na Hupimu viraa waweriti wa likabila ali. Dani kaweriti na mwana yumu, litawu lyakuyi Hushimu.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Nafutali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Nafutali kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Yahasieli na Guni na Yezeri na Shalumu. Mawu gwa Nafutali kaweriti Biliha.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Manasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Manasi kaweriti na wana wawili kulawirana na mmanda yakamtenditi kaweri mdala gwakuyi. Asirieli na Makiri. Makiri kaweriti tati gwakuyi Gileadi. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Makiri kawayugiriti wadala wana wakuyi weni ndo Hupimu na Shupimu. Litawu lya dada gwakuyi Maaka. Mwana gwa pili gwa Makiri kaweriti Selofehadi. Selofehadi kaweriti na wahinga gweka yakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Maaka mdala gwa Makiri, kamwiwuliti mwana litawu lyakuyi Pereshi. Litawu lya mlongu gwakuyi liweriti Shereshi. Wana wakuyi Shereshi waweriti Ulamu na Rakemu. <verse eid="1CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Ulamu kamwiwula Bedani. Woseri awa ndo wiwuka wa Gileadi, Mwana gwa Makiri, mzukulu gwa Manasi. <verse eid="1CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Dada gwakuyi yawamshemiti Hamoleketi kawiwuliti Ishihodi na Abiyezeri na Mahila. <verse eid="1CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Wana wa Shemida waweriti Ahiani na Shekemu na Liki na Aniamu.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Efraimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />Awa ndo wiwuka wa Efraimu kulawa shiyiwuku kwa shiyiwuku. Shutela na Beredi na Tahati na Eleada na Tahati, <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />Zabadi na Shutela. Kuleka na Shutela na Efraimu kaweriti na wana wamonga wawili, Ezeri na Eliyadi, weni walagitwi na wenikaya wa Gati toziya wagenditi aku kuwapoka mifugu yawu. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />Efraimu Tati gwawu kawadayiliriti kuhowa kwawu mashaka mavuwa nentu na walongu wakuyi wiziti kuwakola mawoku. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Shakapanu kagonja kayi na mdala gwakuyi na yomberi kapata yinda, kamwiwula mwana Kamshemiti Beriya, toziya ya madoda yagampatiti mukaya yakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />Efraimu kaweriti na mhinga litawu lyakuyi Sheera. Ayu ndo yakainyawiti miji ya Beti Horoni ya pampindi na ya pasi na Uzeni Sheera. <verse eid="1CH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Awu ndo wiwuka wa Efraimu, Refa na Reshefu na Tela na Tahani, <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />Ladani na Amihudi na Elishama, <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />Nuni na Yoshuwa.<verse eid="1CH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />Isi zawu na makawu gawu gaweriti pamuhera na Beteri na vijiji vyakuyi, Naarani yaguweriti uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji, Gezeri yaguweriti uwega wa kwaguzyetera mshenji pamuhera na Shekemu na vijiji vyakuyi na Aya na vijiji vyakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />Wiwuka wa Manasi walikaliti mumpaka. Beti Sheani na vijiji vyakuyi, Taana na vijiji vyakuyi, Megido na vijiji vyakuyi na Dori na vijiji vyakuyi. Ayi ndo miji yawalikaliti wiwuka wa Yusufu, mwana gwa Israeli.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Asheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Awa ndo wiwuka wa Asheri. Imna na Ishiva na Ishivi na Beriya na mhinga yumu litawu lyakuyi Sera. <verse eid="1CH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Beriya kaweriti na wana wawili. Beriya na Malikieli, yakaweriti tati gwakuyi Birizaiti. <verse eid="1CH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Heberi kaweriti na wana watatu. Yafileti na Shomeri na Hotamu na mhinga yumu litawu lyakuyi Shuwa. <verse eid="1CH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Yafeleti kaweriti na wana watatu. Pasaki na Bimuhali na Ashivati. <verse eid="1CH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Wana wa Shemeri mlongu gwakuyi kaweriti na wana watatu. Roga na Yehuba na Aramu. <verse eid="1CH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Na Helemu, mlongu gwakuyi yumonga, kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Sofa na Imna na Sheleshi na Amali. <verse eid="1CH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Wana wa Sofa waweriti Sua na Harineferi na Shuali na Beri na Imura, <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />Bezeri na Hodu na Shama na Shilisha na Itirani na Beera. <verse eid="1CH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Wana wa Yeteri waweriti, Yefune na Pisipa na Ara. <verse eid="1CH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Wana wa Ula waweriti Ara, Hanieli na Risia. <verse eid="1CH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Woseri awa waweriti wiwuka wa Asheri na waweriti wakulu wa kaya zawu na wantu wasyagulwa na waweriti wagangamala wa nkondu. Walanga ya walii yawalembitwi kwa kugendera nkolu mumashonta iweriti ishilini na sita elufu.<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />Benjamini kaweriti na wana mhanu. Bela mwiwuka gwa kwanja na Ashibeli gwa pili na Ahara gwa tatu, <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />Noha gwa msheshi na Rafa gwa mhanu. <verse eid="1CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Wana wa Bela waweriti. Adari na Gera na Abihudi, <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />Abishuwa na Naamani na Ahoa, <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />Gera na Shefufani na Huramu. <verse eid="1CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6" />Awa ndo wiwuka wa Ehudi, awa wawaweriti wakulu wa kaya za walii yawalikaliti aku Geba, kumbiti wajegiritwi muuhamisiwa Manahati, <verse eid="1CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7" />Naamani na Ahiya na Gera. Gera kaweriti tati gwa Uza na Ahihudi, ndo yakawalonguziyiti kugenda kuluhamila. <verse eid="1CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8" />Shaharaimu kawalekiti wadala wakuyi wawili, Hushimu na Baara. <verse eid="1CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9" />Shakapanu kagenditi kulikala muisi ya Mowabu. Kamyugiti Hodeshi na yomberi kamwiwuliliti wana saba. Yoabu na Sibiya na Mesha na Malikamu, <verse eid="1CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10" />Yewuzi na Sakiya na Mirima. Wana wakuyi awa wiziti kuwera wakulu wa kaya. <verse eid="1CH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11" />Shaharaimu na mdala gwa Hushimu wapatiti wana wamonga wawili. Abitubu na Elipaali. <verse eid="1CH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12" />Wana wapalu wa Elipaali waweriti watatu. Eberi na Mishamu na Shemedi, Shemedi ndo yakayinyawiti miji ya Ono na Lodi pamuhera na vijiji vyavizyengetiti.<verse eid="1CH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabenjamini yawalikaliti Gati na Aiyaloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13" />Beriya na Shema waweriti muwamu mwa wakulu wa kaya yazilikaliti mumiji ya Aiyaloni na kuwawinga wenikaya wa mji gwa Gati. <verse eid="1CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />Na Ahio na Shashaki na Yerimoti, <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />Zebadia na Aradi na Ederi, <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />Mikaeli na Ishipa na Yoha ndo wiwuka wamonga wa Beriya.<verse eid="1CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabenjamini yawalikaliti Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Awu ndo wiwuka wa Zebadia, Meshulamu na Hiziki na Heberi, <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />Ishimerai na Izilia na Yobabu waweriti wiwuka wa Epaali. <verse eid="1CH 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Yakimu na Zikiri na Zabidi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />Elienai na Ziletai na Elieli, <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />Adaya na Beraya na Shimurati waweriti wiwuka wa Shimei. <verse eid="1CH 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Ishipani na Eberi na Elieli, <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />Abudoni na Zikiri na Hanani, <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />Hananiya na Eramu na Anitotoya, <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />Ifideya na Penueli waweriti wiwuka wa Shashaki. <verse eid="1CH 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Shamshera na Sheharia, Atalia, <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />Yaareshia na Eliya na Zikiri waweriti wamu wa wiwuka wa Yeruhamu. <verse eid="1CH 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Awa ndo yawaweriti wakulu wa nkolu zawu kulinganira na viyiwuku vyawu, awa walikaliti Yerusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabenjamini yawalikaliti Gibiyoni na Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />29 Yeieli ndo yakanjishiti mji gwa Gibiyoni. Mdala gwakuyi kaweriti Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />Mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja kaweriti Abudoni. Wana wamonga ndo Zuri na Kishi na Baali na Nadabu, <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />Gedori na Ahio na Zekaria, <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />na Mikiloti tati gwakuyi Shimea. Awa viraa walikaliti Yerusalemu pakwegera na wantu wamonga wa lukolu lwawu<verse eid="1CH 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaya ya mfalumi Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" />Neri kamwiwuliti Kishi, Kishi kamwiwuliti Sauli. Sauli kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Yonatani na Maliki Shuwa na Abinadabu na Eshi Baali. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Yonatani kamwiwuliti Meribi Baali, Meribi Baali kamwiwuliti Mika. <verse eid="1CH 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Mika kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Pitoni na Meleki na Tarea na Ahazi. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Ahazi kamwiwuliti Yehoyada. Yehoyada kawiwuliti Alemeti na Azimaweti na Zimuri. Zimuri kamwiwuliti Mosa. <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Mosa kamwiwuliti Bineya na Beneya kamwiwuliti Rafa na Rafa kamwiwuliti Eleyasa na Eleyasa kamwiwuliti Aseli. <verse eid="1CH 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Wana wa Aseli waweriti sita. Matawu gawu ndo Azirikamu na Bokeru na Ishimaeli na Sheariya na Obadiya na Hanani. Woseri awa waweriti wana wa Aseli. <verse eid="1CH 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Wana wa Esheki, mlongu gwakuyi Aseli, waweriti watatu. Mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja kaweriti Ulamu na gwa pili Yeushi na gwa tatu Elifeleti. <verse eid="1CH 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Wana wa Ulamu waweriti wantu wagangamala nentu wa nkondu na waguma upindi wagangamala. Kaweriti na wana na wazukulu wavuwa, walanga yawu miya yimu amusini. Woseri yawakantitwi waweriti wa lukolu lwa Benjamini.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Wantu yawawuyiti kulawa mukuhamisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Wantu woseri wa israeli walembitwi munkolu na walanga ayi zilembitwi mushitabu sha wafalumi wa Israeli. Toziya wantu wa Yuda waweriti watolitwi lopola kugenda Babuloni toziya ya kuwera ndiri waminika kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" />Wantu wa kwanja kugawuyira makawu gawu mumiji yawu waweriti wantu wa Israeli na watambika na Walawi na wantumintumi wa munumba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Wamu wa wantu kulawa makabira ga Yuda na Benjamini na Efulaimu na Manase wagenditi kulikala kumji gwa Yerusalemu waweriti. <verse eid="1CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4" />Utai mwana gwa Amihudi na mwana gwa Omiri na mwana gwa Imri na mwana gwa Bani, pamuhera na wana gwa Peresi na mwana gwa Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5" />Na wiwuka wa Shiloni, Asaya mwiwuka gwa kwanja na wana wakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6" />Na wiwuka wa Zera, Yeueli na walongu wawu, wantu miya sita tisini. <verse eid="1CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7" />Na wiwuka wa Benjamini. Salu mwana gwa Meshulamu na mwana gwa Hodaviya na mwana gwa Hasenuya, <verse eid="1CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8" />na Ibineya mwana gwa Yerohamu na Ela mwana gwa Uzi, mwana gwa Mikiri na mwana gwa Meshulamu na mwana gwa Shefatiya na mwana gwa Reuweli na mwana gwa Ibiniya, <verse eid="1CH 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />Wantu kulawa Benjamini, ntambu yayilembitwi muwalanga yawu, waweriti miya tisa amusini na sita. Wapalu woseri waweriti wakulu wa kaya zawu.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watambika yawalikaliti Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10" />Watambika awa walikaliti Yerusalemu. Yedaya na Yehoyaribu na Yakini, <verse eid="1CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11" />na Azariya mwana gwa Hilikiya, mwana gwa Meshulamu na mwana gwa Sadoki na mwana gwa Merayoti na mwana gwa Ahitubu yakaweriti mkulu munumba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12" />Na Adaya mwana gwa Yerohamu, na mwana gwa Pashuri na mwana gwa Malikiya na mwana gwa Maasai na mwana gwa Adieli na mwana gwa Yazera na mwana gwa Meshulamu na mwana gwa Meshilemiti na mwana gwa Imeri, <verse eid="1CH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />watambika yawaweriti wakulu wa kaya zawu, walanga yawu wantu elufu yimu miya saba sitini. Waweriti wana uwezu mkulu muutenderu woseri wa numba wa Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi yawalikaliti Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14" />Walawi awa walikaliti Yerusalemu. Shemeya, mwana gwa Hashubu, mwana gwa Azirikamu na mwana gwa Hashabiya na mwana gwa Merari, <verse eid="1CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15" />Bakibakari na Hereshi na Galali na Matania mwana gwa Mika, mwana gwa Zikiri na mwana gwa Asafu, <verse eid="1CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16" />Obadiya mwana gwa Shemaya na mwana gwa Galali na mwana gwa Yedutuni na Berekia, mwana gwa Asa na mwana gwa Elikana, weni walikaliti muvijiji vya Wanetofati.<verse eid="1CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walolera wa numba nkulu yawalikariti Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17" />Awa ndo walolera wa numba ya Mlungu yawalikaliti Yerusalemu ndo: Shalumu na Akubu na Talimoni na Ahimani na Walawi wayawu. Shalumu kaweriti mkulu gwawu. <verse eid="1CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18" />Mpaka kusoka shaka ashi, walolera kulawa munkolu zawu ndo yawaloliliti Ligomi lya mfalumi lyaliweriti uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji lyakapitiliti mfalumi. Panu kwanja, waweriti walolera wa magomi ga mung'onjeru ya Walawi. <verse eid="1CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19" />Shalumu, mwana gwa Kore na mwana gwa Ebiyasafu, pamuhera na walongu wakuyi wa lukolu lwa Kora, waweriti na mahengu ga kugalolera weri mayingiru ga numba nkulu ya kuliwona, ntambu yawaweriti wambuyi wakuyi shaka sha ulolera wa ng'onjeru ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" />Finehasi, mwana gwa Eleyazari, kaweriti mlongoziya gwawu, mashaka gapititi na Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" />Zekaria mwana gwa Meshelemiya, viraa kaweriti mlolera muligomi lya liringu linanagala. <verse eid="1CH 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Walolera woseri wa magomi ga numba nkulu ya Mlungu waweriti miya mbili lilongu na mbili. Walembitwi kulinganira na vijiji vyawalikaliti. Mfalumi Dawudi na Samueli mlola ndo yawatakuliti yina kwa lihengu lya kuwasyagula walolera awa. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />Su, wantu awa na wiwuka wawu, wendereyiti kuyilolera migomi mikulu ya numba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />Kila uwega wa kwagulawira mshenji na kwaguzyetera mshenji, kushana na kusika, paweriti na ligomi lyaliweriti na walolera. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />Walolera awa watangitwi na walawi wayawu yawalikaliti kuvijiji, weni wafiriwitwi kuwera mumahengu ga ulolera kwa shaka sha mashaka saba. <verse eid="1CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />Walii walolera wakulu wamsheshi, weni waweriti Walawi, waweriti na lihengu lya kugolokera vyumba na luhanja lwa numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />Womberi walikaliti pakwegera na numba nkulu ya Mlungu toziya iweriti lihengu lyawu lya kuyilolera na kuvugula migomi yakuyi kila lishaka mandawira.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga Walawi wamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Wamu wa Walawi waweriti walolera wa vyombu vyavitenderitwi shaka sha kuguwira. Wafiruwitwi kuviwalanga pavilaviwitwi na paviwuziwitwi. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />Wamonga wasyagulitwi kugolokera vyombu vinanagala vya numba nkulu ya Mlungu na vyombu vyoseri vinanagala na ubumu uherepa na divayi na lipaki lya mizeyituni na ubani na utuli. <verse eid="1CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Kumbiti lihengu lya kutanda utuli litenditwi na watambika.<verse eid="1CH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Metitiya, yumu gwa Walawi yakaweriti mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Shalumu, gwa lukolu lwa Kora, kagolokeriti kunyawa kwa tambiku ya mabumunda. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />Walongu wawu wamonga wa lukolu lwa Kohati waweriti na mahengu ga kutanda mabumunda ga languziwu kwajili ya numba nkulu ya Mlungu kila lishaka lya kwoyera. <verse eid="1CH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Kaya zimonga za Walawi ziweriti zakwimba munumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Walikaliti muwamu mwa numba za Mlungu na wafiruwitwi ndiri kutenda mahengu gamonga goseri toziya waweriti mlihengu pashiru na paliwala.<verse eid="1CH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Wantu woseri awa yawakanditwi waweriti wakulu wa likabila lya Walawi, kulinganira na nkolu zawu. Womberi ndo wakulu yawalikaliti Yerusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambuyi na wiwuka wa mfalumi Sauli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 8:29-38">8:29-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />Yaieli mwanjisha gwa mji gwa Gibiyoni kalikaliti aku Gibiyoni, mdala gwakuyi litawu lyakuyi kaweriti Maaka, <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />Mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja kaweriti Abudoni, kafatitwi na Zuri na Kishi na Baali na Neri na Nadabu, <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />Gedori na Ahiyo na Zekariya na Mikiloti. <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Mikiloti kamwiwula Shimeyamu. Wiwuka wawu walikaliti Yerusalemu pakwegera na kaya zimonga za nkolu zawu. <verse eid="1CH 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" />Neri kamwiwuliti Kishi na Kishi kamwiwula Sauli. Sauli kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Yonatani na Maliki Shuwa na Abinadabu na Eshibaali. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Yonatani kamwiwula Meribu Baali na Meribu Baali kamwiwula Mika. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Mika waweriti na wana wamsheshi. Pitoni na Meleki na Tareya na Ahazi. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Ahazi kamwiwuliti Yara, Yara kawiwula Alemeti na Azimaweti na Zimiri na Zimiri kamwiwula Mosa. <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Mosa kamwiwula Bineya na Bineya kamwiwula Refaya na Refaya kamwiwula Eleyasa na Eleyasa kamwiwula Aseli.<verse eid="1CH 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Aseli kaweriti na wana sita. Azirikamu na Bokeru na Ishimaeli na Sheariya na Obadiya na Hamani. Wana woseri awa waweriti wana wa Aseli.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Mfalumi Sauli pamuhera na wana wakuyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1 Samweli 31:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Su wafiristi walikomanga na wantu wa Israeli. Waisraeli watugiti kulongolu kwa Wafilisti na kulaguwa kulugongu lwa Giliboa. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Kumbiti Wafiristi wawabatiti Sauli na wana wakuyi na wawalaga Yonatani na Abinadabu na Maliki Shua. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Makomangu gaweriti makulu pahala pakaweriti Sauli. Wagumiti misali na kutendwa nentu.<verse eid="1CH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />Sauli kamgambiriti muntu yakampapiliti vintu vya kulikomangira, “Gusomoli ligumba lyaku gunsomi nfuwi, su Wafiristi awa yawamguwira ndiri Mlungu nawiza kunzoniziya.” Kumbiti mpapa vintu vyakulikomangira kajeriti ndiri, toziya katiriti nentu. Hangu, Sauli katoliti ligumba lyakuyi na kuliguwira. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />Shakapanu mshonta ulii pakamwoniti Sauli kahowa na yomberi kasomeka ligumba lyakuyi kaliguwira, kahowa. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Hangu Sauli ndo ntambu yakahowiti, na wana wakuyi watatu na wiwuka wakuyi woseri. <verse eid="1CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Waisraeli woseri yawalikaliti kululalanda lwa Yezeleli pawawoniti wamashonta wawatira wankondu handa Sauli na wana wakuyi wahowa, wayihamiti miji watuga. Wafilisti wagenda na kulikala mumiji ayi.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Shirawu yakuyi Wafiristi pawagenditi kutola vintu vya yawalagitwi awa, wagawoniti mauti ga Sauli na wana wakuyi mulugongu Giliboa. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" />Wamvula nguwu za nkondu, wagutola mtuwi gwakuyi, pamuhera na vintu vyakuyi vya kulikomangira, shakapanu watumiti walagilagi muisi yoseri ya Wafiristi kubwera shisoweru ashi kwa vinyagu vyawu na wantu wawu. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />Watuliti vintu vya kulikomangira vya Sauli munumba nkulu ya wamlungu wawu, Shakapanu kugutyeteziya mtuyi gwakuyi munumba nkulu ya mlungu gwawu Dagoni. <verse eid="1CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Wenikaya woseri wa Yabeshi Gileyadi pawapikiniriti goseri Wafiristi ntambu yawamtendiriti Sauli, <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />wamakambaku woseri wawukiti na kuyitola nshimba ya Sauli na nshimba za wana wakuyi watatu, wayijega mpaka Yabeshi. Wayifintira mihonju yawu pasi pa mtera yagushemwa mwaloni aku Yabeshi na walikaliti pota kuliya toziya ya kuwalirira kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="1CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13" />Sauli kahowiti toziya kaweriti ndiri mwaminika na kashijimiriti ndiri shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu yomberi kagenditi kwa mtunga kuluwa shakutenda, <verse eid="1CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14" />viraa kagenditi ndiri kwa Mtuwa Mlungu su kuluwa shakutenda. Toziya ayi Mtuwa Mlungu kamlagiti na ufalumi wakuyi kampanana Dawudi mwana gwa Yese.<verse eid="1CH 10:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuwera Mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">2 Samweli 5:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli wamgendiriti Dawudi aku Hebroni wamgambira, “Twenga twa walongu waku wa mwazi. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />Shaka shashipititi, Sauli pakaweriti mfalumi gwenga ndo yagulonguziyiti waisraeli munkondu na Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku kakugambiziyiti, haguweri mlonguziya gwa wantu waneni Israeli na haguweri mkulu gwa wantu waneni Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Su wazewi woseri wa Israeli wamgendera mfalumi aku Hebroni na Dawudi katenda lipatanu nawu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Shakapanu wamwitira lipaki Dawudi kaweri mfalumi gwa Israeli kulinganira na shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti Samueli.”<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />Mfalumi Dawudi na wamashonta woseri Israeli wagenditi na kugukomanga mji gwa Yerusalemu yagumanikaniti handa Yebusi na wenikaya wakuyi waweriti Wayebusi yawalikaliti amu. <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />Wenikaya wa Yebusi wamgambira Dawudi, “Hapeni gwingili mji agu.” Ata hangu, Dawudi kalilopola liboma lya Siyoni, na shakapanu gushemitwi mji gwa Dawudi. <verse eid="1CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Dawudi kagagambira mashonta gakuyi, “Muntu gwa kwanja yakalonguziya kuwakomanga Wayebusi, hakaweri Mkulu gwa wamashonta.” Na Yoabu mwana gwa Seruya kaweriti gwa kwanja kuwakomanga na hangu kawera mkulu gwa mashonta. <verse eid="1CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Dawudi kalikaliti muliboma ali, hangu, mji agu gushemwa mji gwa Dawudi. <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Kagunyawiti mji agu, pakanjira Milo na kuguzyengeta goseri na Yoabu kamaliriti pahala papasigaliti. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" />Dawudi kendereyiti kuwera na makakala nentu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walanga ya makambaku wa nkondu wa Dawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2 Samweli 23:8-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />Ayi ndo walanga ya wakulu wa makambaku wa nkondu wa Dawudi, weni pamuhera na wantu wamonga woseri wa Israeli, yawamtankiti su kaweri mfalumi, teratera na shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shakashilaviyiti kwa Waisreli. <verse eid="1CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />Gwa kwanja kaweriti Yashobeyamu gwa lukolu lwa Mhakimoni yakaweriti mkulu gwa wamashonta yomberi katenderiti msali kuwalaga wantu miya tatu, mu likomangu limu. <verse eid="1CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />Yakafatiti kaweriti Eleazari mwana gwa Dodo kulawa lukolu lwa Ahohi yumu gwa vikambaku watatu walii. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />Ayu kaweriti na Dawudi aku Pasi Damimu, shaka Wafiristi pawalijojoneriti aku kwajiri ya nkondu. Kweni aku kuweriti na lilambu limema shayiri, wantu wa Israeli pawanjiti kuwatira Wafiristi. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Kumbiti womberi wagolikiti ugangamala pakati pa lilambu lilii su kulilewelera, wawakanka Wafiristi. Mtuwa Mlungu kawalopola kwa kuwapanana ukanka mkulu.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Shakapanu makambaku watatu pakati pa wakulu selasini waseleriti mpaka kulitalawu, wamgendera Dawudi kumpanga aku Adulamu. Shaka ashi shonta lya Wafilisti liweriti litula ng'onjeru mululalanda lwa Refaimu. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />Shaka shirii Dawudi kaweriti muliboma na lishonta lya Wafiristi liweriti kumuji gwa Betilehemu. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />Dawudi kaweriti na hamu ya mashi ga ukayakwakuyi su kalonga, “Handa muntu mekawezi kumpanana mashi ga kulanda kulawa mulinegu lya Betilehemu lyaliweriti pakwegera na ligomi lya mji!” <verse eid="1CH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Makambaku watatu walii walawiti, wapena pakati pa ng'onjeru ya lishonta lya Wafilisti, wagenda na kuteka mashi kulinegu lilii, pakwegera na ligomi lya mji, wamjegera Dawudi. Kumbiti Dawudi kalema kugalanda na yomberi kagita pasi handa tambiku kwa Mtuwa Mlungu <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />pakalonga, “Shitendu handa ashi shipitiziwi kutali na neni, weza ndiri kushitenda kulongolu kwa Mlungu gwangu. Hashi, guweza kulanda mwazi gwa ukomu wa wantu awa? Toziya wahatarishiti ukomu wawu kwa kugajega mashi aga.” Hangu Dawudi kagalanda ndiri mashi aga. Ayi ndo mirandu yawayitenditi makambaku watatu walii. <verse eid="1CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Abishai, mlongu gwa Yoabu, kaweriti mkulu gwa makambaku selasini. Kalikomangiti kwa mgowa gwakuyi kwa wantu miya tatu, kawalaga, na kamanikiti ndiri pakati pa makambaku watatu. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />Shakapanu kamanika nentu muwamu mwa makambaku selasini, ata kawera mkulu gwa lishonta lyawu, kumbiti kamanikaniti ndiri handa walii wagangamala watatu.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, kulawa Kabizeeli kaweriti lishonta mgangamala mweni katenditi mirandu mivuwa vilavilii kalagiti vikambaku wawili kulawa Mowabu na lishaka limu shaka sha balafu, kasulukiti na kulaga simba kulilindi. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Viraa, kamlagiti Mumisiri yumu, muntu mtali nentu, utali wakuyi nentu ya mita mbili na mumawoku mwakuyi kaweriti kajega mgoha mkulu nentu, handa mtera gwa mpota. Kumbiti Benaya kamkomiti na luhonga hera, kampoka mgoha agu na kumlaga Mmisri ayu kwa mgoha gwakuyi mweni. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada katenditi mirandu ayi, kamanikaniti nentu pakati pa makambaku selasini walii. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />Kaweriti kamanika pakati pa makambaku selasini, kumbiti kaweriti ndiri handa vikambaku watatu walii. Shakapanu Dawudi kampanana ulonguziya wa walolera wakuyi mweni.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />Wamashonta makambaku wa Dawudi waweriti. Asaheli mlongu gwa Yoabu na Elihanani mwana gwa Dodo kulawa Betilehemu na <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />Shamoti na Mharodi na Helesi kulawa Peloni, <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />Ira, mwana gwa Ikeshi kulawa Tekoa na Abiezeri kulawa Anatoti, <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />Sibekai kulawa Hushati na Ilai kulawa Ahohiti, <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />Maharai Kulawa Netofati na Heledi mwana gwa Baana kulawa Netofatite, <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />Itai, mwana gwa Ribai kulawa Gibea, gwa likabira lya Benjamini na Benaya kulawa Piratoni na <verse eid="1CH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />Hurai kulawa muvishemba vya Gaashi, Abiyeli kulawa Aibati, <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />Azimaweti kulawa Baharumi, Eliyaba kulawa Shaaliboni, <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />wana wa Yasheni Mgiloni na Yonatani, mwana gwa Shagee Mharari, <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />Ahiamu, mwana gwa Sakari kulawa Harari, Elifale, mwana gwa Uri, <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />Heferi Mmekerati na Ahiya Mpeloni, <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />Heziro kulawa Karimeli na Naarai na mwana gwa Ezibayi na <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />Yoweli, mlongu gwa Natani na Mibihari, mwana gwa Hagiri, <verse eid="1CH 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />Zeleki kulawa Amoni na Naharai kulawa Beoruti, yakaweriti mpapa vintu vya kulikomangira gwa Yoabu, mwana gwa Seruya, <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />Ira na Garebu, yawaweriti Waitiri, <verse eid="1CH 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />Uria Mhiti na Zabadi, mwana gwa Ahilai, <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />Adina, mwana gwa Shiza Mrubeni, mkulu gwa Warubeni pakawera pamuhera na wantu selasini, <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />Hanani mwana gwa Maaka na Yoshafati Mmitini, <verse eid="1CH 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />Uzia Mwashiterati na Shama na Yeieli na wana gwa Hotamu na Mwaroeri na <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />Yediali na Yoha mlongu gwakuyi na mwana gwa Shimiri na mlongu gwa Yoha kulawa Tizi na <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />Elieli kulawa Mahawi na Yeribai na Yoshavia wana wa Holinaamu, Itima kulawa Mowabu na <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />Elieli na Obedi na Yaasieli na Mmesobai.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Wantu yawamfatiti Dawudi kulawa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />Awa ndo wapalu yawaweriti pamuhera na Dawudi aku Sikilagi, pakaweriti kalififa toziya ya mfalumi Sauli mwana gwa Kishi, waweriti muwamu mwa wanjagila makambaku yawamtangiti kunkondu. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />Awa waweriti wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini ntambu yakawera Sauli. Waweriti waguma upindi wagangamala na waguma mabuhi kwa luwembelu kwa kutendera mawoku goseri ga kumliwu na kumshigi. <verse eid="1CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />Awa ndo Ahiezeri, yakatangitwi na Yowashi, woseri waweriti wana wa Shemaya kulawa Gibea, wamonga ndo Yezieli na Peleti, wana wa Azimaweti na Beraka na Yehu kulawa Anatoti, <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />Ishimaia kulawa Gibiyoni, muntu shikambaku muwamu mwa walii selasini na mkulu gwawu viraa pamuhera na Yeremiya na Yahazieli na Yohanani na Yozabadi kulawa Gedera, <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />Eluzai na Yerimoti na Bealia na Shemaria na Shefatiya na Mharufi, <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />Elikana na Ishia na Azareli na Yoezeri na Yashobeamu kulawa lukolu lwa Kora <verse eid="1CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />na Yoela na Zebadia na wana wa Yerohamu, kulawa Gedori.<verse eid="1CH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu yawamfatiti Dawudi kulawa likabila lya Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />Kayi, wantu kulawa likabira lya Gadi waweriti pamuhera na Dawudi kuliboma kushiwala kulii. Awa waweriti wanjagila wana makakala wazowelera, wagangamala kwa nkondu na kutendera ngawu na migoha na wana vyeni vya kutiliziya handa simba na wayewuka handa swala kumigongu. <verse eid="1CH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9" />Mlonguziya gwawu mkulu kaweriti Ezeri na gwa pili Obadiya na gwa tatu Eliyabu, <verse eid="1CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10" />gwa msheshi Mishimana na mhanu Yeremiya, <verse eid="1CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11" />gwa sita Atai na gwa saba Elieli, <verse eid="1CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12" />gwa nani Yohanani na gwa tisa Elizabadi, <verse eid="1CH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13" />gwa lilongu Yeremiya na gwa lilongu na yumu Makibanai. <verse eid="1CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Wagadi awa, waweriti wakulu wa mashonta. Kulinganira na ukulu wawu, mpusu kagolokeriti shipinga sha wamashonta miya na mkulu kagolokeriti shipinga sha wamashonta elufu yimu. <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" />Awa ndo wantu yawalokiti lushemba Yoridani mumwezi gwa kwanja, lushemba paluweriti lumema ng'anji wega zoseri na kuwapalasiya wantu kwagulawa mshenji na kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba.<verse eid="1CH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu yawamfatiti Dawudi kulawa Benjamini na Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />Wantu wamu kulawa likabira lya Benjamini na Yuda vilavilii wiziti kuliboma pakaweriti Dawudi. <verse eid="1CH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />Dawudi kalawa kunja kwiza kuwanka na kawagambira, “Handa mwiza kwa neni handa waganja su kuntanga niwanka kwa moyu goseri, Kumbiti handa mwiza kungalambuka kwa wankondu wangu na neni hanenitendi likontola lyoseri, Mlungu gwa watati wetu kaguwoni mlandu agu na kawatozi.” <verse eid="1CH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Shakapanu Rohu kamwiziriti Amasai, mkulu gwa wantu selasini awa na yomberi kalonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">“Twenga twa wantu waku, gwee Dawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">twa uwega waku, gwee mwana gwa Yese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">Ponga, ponga iweri kwa gwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">na ponga iweri kwa yoseri yakakutanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">Nakaka Mlungu gwaku ndo yanakakutangi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 12:18">Shakapanu Dawudi pakawankiti na kuwatenda wakulu mulishonta lyakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandundami wa Dawudi kulawa Manasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />Mashonta wamonga wa likabila lya Manasi waweliti pamuhera na Dawudi, shaka Dawudi pakalikoliti na Wafilisti kugenda kulikomanga na Sauli. Kumbiti ata hangu, wawatangiti ndiri toziya wakolamlima waligambiziyaniti wamwingi kawuyi Sikilagi pawalonga, “Hatuliponzi toziya hakatutoloki kawuyi ukaya kwa mtuwa gwakuyi Sauli.” <verse eid="1CH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />Shaka Dawudi pakaweriti Sikilagi, wantu awa wa likabira lya Manasi waweriti pamuhera nayu. Adina na Yozabadi na Yediaeli na Mikaeli na Yozabadi na Elihu na Siletai. Kila yumu gwawu kaweriti mlonguziya gwa shipinga sha wantu elufu yimu mulikabira lya Manasi. <verse eid="1CH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />Wamtangiti Dawudi kulikomanga na shipinga shawankondu wakuyi wawiziti kumkomangiti, toziya woseri waweriti wamashonta na wakulu wa makambaku kulishonta. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />Lishaka ata lishaka, wantu waweriti pamuhera na Dawudi kumtanga, upeleru wakuyi kawera na lishonta likulu nentu, handa lishonta lya Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walanga ya lishonta lya Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Ayi ndo walanga ya vipinga vya wamashonta wana vintu vya kulikomangira yawaweriti pamuhera na Dawudi aku Hebroni su kumpanana ufalumi kulawa kwa Sauli, kulinganira na shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Wantu wa likabira lya Yuda yawaweriti na migowa na ngawu, waweriti elufu sita miya nani. Woseri waweriti kala kwa nkondu. <verse eid="1CH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />Wamashonta kulawa likabila lya Simioni, wantu elufu saba miya yimu vikambaku yawavimana nentu nkondu. <verse eid="1CH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />Wamashonta kulawa likabila lya Lawi. Waweriti elufu msheshi miya sita <verse eid="1CH 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />Pamuhera na Yehoyada gwa wiwuka wa Aruni na wayaguyi. Waweriti elufu tatu miya saba. <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />Pamuhera na Sadoki, mntemba shikambaku kunkondu, yomberi pamuhera na wakulu wa mashonta ishilini na wawili kulawa mukaya yakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Mashonta kulawa likabila lya Benjamini, lyeni vilaa likabila lya Sauli. Wantu elufu tatu. Wavuwa wawu wasigaliti waminika kwa kaya ya Sauli mpaka panu pawamgenderiti Dawudi, <verse eid="1CH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Mashonta kulawa likabila lya Efraimu. Wantu ishilini elufu miya nani, wantu vikambaku nentu kayi wamanika munkolu zawu, <verse eid="1CH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Mashonta kulawa nusu ya likabila lya Manasi yawaweriti kwaguzyetera mshenji. Wantu lilongu na nani elufu, yawakantitwi matawu su wizi kumlumika Dawudi kaweri mfalumi. <verse eid="1CH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Mashonta kulawa likabila lya Isakari, wakulu miya mbili pamuhera na walongu wawu yawaweriti wawalonguziya. Wakulu awa waweriti na mahala ga kumana mirandu ya shaka na wamaniti shawafiluwitwi Waisraeli kutenda. <verse eid="1CH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />Mashonta kulawa likabila lya Zabuloni. Wantu elufu hamusini, waminika na wazowelera wa nkondu. Walitanditi na vintu vya kulikomangira nkondu za kila ntambu, nfiru yawu iweriti ndo kumtanga hera Dawudi. <verse eid="1CH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Mashonta kulawa likabila lya Nafutali. Wakulu wa mashonta elufu yimu na wantu selasini na saba elufu yawaweriti na ngawu na migoha. <verse eid="1CH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Mashonta kulawa likabila lya Dani. Wantu elufu ishilini na nani miya sita yawaweriti na vintu vya kulikomangira wawera kala kwa nkondu. <verse eid="1CH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />Mashonta kulawa likabila lya Asheri. Wantu elufu alubayini yawaweriti kala kwa nkondu. <verse eid="1CH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Mashonta kulawa likabila lya Warubeni, Wagadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi kulawa kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani. Wantu laki yimu ishilini elufu wana kila ntambu ya vintu vya kulikomangira vya nkondu.<verse eid="1CH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Wamashonta woseri awa, yawalitanditi kala kwa nkondu, wagenditi Hebroni na nfiru yawu nkulu iweriti kumlumika Dawudi kaweri mfalumi gwa Israeli yoseri. Na wantu woseri wa Israeli, viraa waweriti pamuhera na nfiru yimu ya kumlumika Dawudi kaweri mfalumi.<verse eid="1CH 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Su walikaliti na Dawudi kwa shaka sha mashaka matatu, pawaliya na kulanda toziya walongu wawu waweriti wawatandira kala viboga. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />Nentu ya aga, wapakwegera wawu na ata wa kutali handa aku Isakari na Zebuluni na Nafutali, wawajegeriti viboga vyawapapiti kwa mupunda na ngamiya na pundafarasi na ng'ombi. Wawajegeriti ubumu, mabumunda ga tini na visana ya zabibu iyuma na divayi na lipaki na ng'ombi na kondolu wavuwa. Vilavilii kuweriti na viboga vivuwa, toziya kwaniti nemeleru Muisraeli.<verse eid="1CH 12:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Lisandiku lya lipatanu lyanguhamisiwa kulawa Kiriyati Yearimu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2 Samweli 6:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />Dawudi kayowiriti na wakulu wa mashonta wa vipinga vya maelufu na vipinga vya mamiya, pamuhera na wakulu woseri. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />Shakapanu kawagambira Waisraeli woseri yawajojonikiti, “Payiwera hamjimirani na neni na payiwera ndo mafiru gakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu na tutendi hangu. Tulagaliri walagilagi wagendi wakawashemi walongu wetu yawasigaliti muisi ya Israeli, pamuhera na watambika na Walawi yawawera kumiji yawu na maliwuziwu gawu wizi waweri pamuhera na twenga. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Shakapanu tugendi twakalitoli lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mlungu gwetu, toziya tuliloleritindiri shaka sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Sauli.” <verse eid="1CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Wantu woseri wajimiraniti na shawatakuliti ashi toziya wawoniti kuwera shitwatira shiheri.<verse eid="1CH 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" />Hangu Dawudi kawajojonira Waisraeli woseri muisi, kwanjira lushemba lwa Shihori mpaka kusika mwa Israeli mpaka mayingiliru ga Hamati su kulijega Lisandiku lya Mlungu kulawa Kiriyati Yearimu kugenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" />Dawudi pakawera na Waisraeli woseri, wagenda mpaka mjini Baala, gweni ndo Kiriyati Yearimu, muisi ya Yudea, su kulitola kulawa aku Lisandiku lya Mlungu lyalipapwa kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu yakalikala mushiti shakuyi sha ufalumi pampindi pa viwumbi vyana mpapatiru. <verse eid="1CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />Su, walitoliti lisanduku lya Mlungu kulawa kunumba ya Aminadabu mumbutuka ya Syayi. Uza na Ahio wayiyendeshiti mbutuka ayi yayikwegitwi na ng'ombi. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />Dawudi pamuhera na Waisraeli woseri waweriti wankuvina kwa makakala gawu goseri, kulongolu kwa Mlungu. Wimbiti ugawu pawagomba zezi na vinubi na vinanda na matali na kayamba na matowazi. <verse eid="1CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />Pawasokiti paluwaga lwa kukomera viboga lwa Kidoni, Uza katalipisiyiti liwoku lyakuyi kulikolera Lisandiku lya lipatanu toziya ng'ombi kaweriti kalikwala. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Katepu Mtuwa Mlungu kamkalalira Uza toziya kakola lisandiku su kamlaga. Uza kahowa palapalii kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Dawudi kakalaliti toziya maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gaweriti kwa Uza. Toziya ayi, pahala panu pashemitwi Peresi Uza, toziya Mlungu kamkomangiti Uza. <verse eid="1CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />Lishaka lilii Dawudi kamtiriti Mlungu, kalonga, “Vinu, hanilitoli hashi Lisandiku la Mlungu ukaya kwaneni?” <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Hangu Dawudi kalitoliti ndiri Lisandiku mpaka Yerusalemu, ila kalijegiti ukaya kwa Obedi Edomu yakalikala mji gwa Gati. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" />Lisandiku lya Mlungu lisigaliti kwa Obedi Edomu, kwa shaka sha miyezi mitatu na Mtuwa Mlungu kayitekeleriti numba ya Obed Edomu na vintu vyakuyi vyoseri.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga Dawudi Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">2 Samweli 5:11-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Shakapanu mfalumi Hiramu gwa Tiro kawalagalira walagilagi kwa Dawudi na viraa kamjegiriti miyelezi na wanyawa yawanyawa kwa mabuwi na wasongola mtera, su wamnyawiri liboma yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Hangu, Dawudi kavimaniti handa Mtuwa Mlungu kamgangamaziya yomberi kaweri mfalumi gwa Israeli na kuwera ufalumi wakuyi utekelerwa nentu toziya ya wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />Aku Yerusalemu, Dawudi kayugiti wadala wamonga nentu, yomberi kawiwula wana wavuwa wapalu na wahinga wamonga. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" />Aga ndo matawu ga wana yakawiwuliti aku Yerusalemu, Shamua na Shobabi na Natani na Selemani, <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />Ibihari na Elishua na Elipeleti, <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />Noga na Nefegi na Yafia, <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />Elishama na Beeliada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuwakanka Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2 Samweli 5:17-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Wafiristi pawapikaniriti handa Dawudi kwitirwa lipaki kuwera mfalumi gwa isi yoseri ya Israeli, wamashonta wawu wawukiti kwa uvuwa kugenda kumsakula, kumbiti Dawudi kapatitikala visoweru, kawukiti kugenda kulikomanga nawa. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Wafiristi pawasokiti mululalanda lwa Refaimu wanja kuwapoka wantu vintu vyawu kwa makakala. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />Hangu Dawudi ndo pakamkosiyiti Mlungu shakutenda. “Hashi, ng'endi kuwakomanga Wafiristi? Hashi, haguntendi niwakanki?” Na Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gugendi, hanikupanani ukanka.”<verse eid="1CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Hangu Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wakweniti mpaka Baali Perasimu, kawakanka aku. Shakapanu kalonga, “Mlungu kapita kwa makakala pakati pa wankondu wa neni kwa liwoku lyangu, handa malawa ga mashi yagagenda kalongola.” Su pahala palii wapashemiti Baali Perasimu. <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Wafilisti pawatiriti, walekiti vinyagu vya wamlumgu wawu aku na Dawudi kalagaliriti ilunguziwi motu.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Katepu Wafiristi wawapokiti mululalanda alu kawili kayi, <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />Hangu Dawudi kamkosiyiti kayi Mlungu, Mlungu kamgambira, “Naguwakomanga lishonta lya Wafiristi kulawira kulongolu kwawu, ila guwazyengeti na kuwakomanga kulawira kumbeli kwawu, kulongolu kumitera ya miforosadi. <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />Katepu pagupikanira mlindimiru gwa mashonta yawapita kumpeleru za mitera ya miforosadi ayi, su gulawi kalongola kuwakomanga. Haweri kala nikulongolera kulikomanga lishonta lya Wafiristi.” <verse eid="1CH 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />Dawudi katenditi ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mlungu. Kalikomanga lishonta lya Wafiristi kwanjira Gibeoni mpaka Gezeri. <verse eid="1CH 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Hangu Dawudi kamanika kuisi yoseri na Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenda wantu wa isi zoseri zimtira yomberi.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Matandiru ga kulihamiziya Lisandiku lya Lipatanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />Su Dawudi kalinyawiriti numba zivuwa kumji gwa Dawudi. Kanyawiliti pahala toziya ya Lisandiku lya Mlungu na kagolosiyiti lilingu. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" />Shakapanu kalonga, “Kwahera muntu gwingi yoseri gwakulipapa Lisanduku lya Mlungu ila Walawi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawasyaguliti womberi kulipapa na kumtendera lihengu mashaka goseri.” <verse eid="1CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />Hangu, kawajojonira Waisraeli woseri wizi Yerusalemu, su kulijega Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, pahala pakalitandiriti kala. <verse eid="1CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />Shakapanu Dawudi kawashemiti wiwuka wa Aruni na Walawi. <verse eid="1CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />Kulawa mlukolu lwa Kohati pa ulongoziwa na Urieli, pamuhera na walongu wakuyi miya yimu ishilini pasi pa ugolokera wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />Kulawa mulukolu lwa Merari pa ulongoziwa na Asaya pamuhera na walongu wakuyi miya mbili ishilini pasi pa ugolokera wakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />Kulawa mulukolu lwa Gerishomu, pa ulongoziwa na Yoeli pamuhera na walongu wakuyi miya yimu selasini pasi pa ugolokera wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />Kulawa mulukolu lwa Elisafani, pa ulongoziwa na Shemaya pamuhera na walongu wakuyi miya mbili pasi pa ugolokera wakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />Kulawa mulukolu lwa Hebroni, pa ulongoziwa na Elieli pamuhera na walongu wakuyi semanini pasi pa ugolokera wakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />Kulawa mulukolu lwa Uzieli, pa ulongoziwa na Aminadabu pamuhera na walongu wakuyi miya yimu lilongu na mbili pasi pa ugolokera wakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />Shakapanu Dawudi kawashema watambika wawili. Sadoki na Abiatari na Walawi sita. Urieli na Asaya na Yoeli na Shemaya na Elieli na Aminadabu, <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />kawagambira, “Mwenga ndo wakulu wa nkolu za Walawi. Mlitakasiyi pamuhera na walongu wenu Walawi, su mwakalijegi lisanduku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, mpaka pahala peni panilitandiliti. <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" />Toziya mlipapiti ndiri mwanja gwa kwanja, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, katukomangiti toziya tulishera ndiri ntambu yakalagaliriti.” <verse eid="1CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />Su, watambika na Walawi walitakasiya su wapati kulijega lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" />Walawi walipapiti mumawega mwawu pawatendera mihanya yakuyi handa Musa ntambu yakalongiti, kulinganira na shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />Dawudi viraa kawagambiriti wakulu wa Walawi wawasyaguli wamu wa walongu wawu waweri pawimba na kugomba vyombu vya muziki kwa lusekeru. Vinanda na vinubi na matowazi kwa likakala, su kulaviya maziwu kwa nemeru. <verse eid="1CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Hangu wasyagula wantu kulawa munkolu za wimbaji. Hemani mwana gwa Yoeli, Asafu mlongu gwakuyi yakaweriti mwana gwa Berekia na wana wa Merari, walongu wawu na Etani mwana gwa Kushaya. <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />Shakapanu wasyagula Walawi waweri watanga wawu kwa kuwera nafasi ya pili. Zekaria na Yaasieli na Shemiramoti na Yehieli na Uni na Eliyabu na Benaya na Maaseya na Matitia na Elifelehu na Mikineya na walolera wa ligomi likulu waweriti Obedi Edomu na Yeieli. <verse eid="1CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Wayimba waweriti, Hemani na Asafu na Etani wasyagulitwi kugomba matowazi ga shaba. <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />Zekaria na Aziyeli na Shemiramoti na Yehieli na Uni na Eliyabu na Maaseyu na Benaya waweriti wagomba vinubi kwa mtindu yagushemwa Alamoti. <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />Kumbiti Matitia na Elifelehu na Mikineya na Obedi Edomu na Yeieli na Azazia walonguziya pawawera na vinubi vya liziwu lya Sheminiti. <verse eid="1CH 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Kenania toziya ya umani wa muziki wakaweriti nawu, katulitwi kaweri mkulu gwa walawi yawaweriti wankwimba. <verse eid="1CH 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23" />Berekia na Elikana waweriti walolera wa Lisanduku lya lipatanu. <verse eid="1CH 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24" />Shebania na Yoshafati na Netaneli na Amasai na Zekaria na Benaya na Eliezeri yawaweriti watambika, watulitwi kugomba lipenka kulongolu kusandiku lya Mlungu. Obedi Edomu na Yehiya watulitwi kuwera walolera wa Lisandiku.<verse eid="1CH 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisandiku lya lipatanu langujeguwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 6:12-22">2 Samweli 6:12-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />Mfalumi Dawudi pakapikiniriti kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kawatekelera walongu wa Obedi Edomu na vintu vyoseri vyakaweriti navi toziya ya lisandiku la Mtuwa Mlungu, kagenda kulitola lisandiku lya patanu kulawa ukaya kwa Obedi Edomu na kujega kulushi lwa Dawudi kwa sheleku nkulu. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />Wamlavilira tambiku Mlungu. Wang'ombi washipalu saba na kondolu shipalu saba toziya kawatangiti Walawi walii yawapapiti lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Dawudi kaweriti kavala nguwu nfufu, ntambu iraa na Walawi woseri yawapapiti lisandiku, wimba na Kenania mlonguziya gwa yawimba. Pamuhera na lihabiti ali, Dawudi viraa kaweriti kavala shizibawu sha nguwu nfufu. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Hangu, Waisraeli woseri waweriti pamuhera kwa sheleku kulitola lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu mpaka Yerusalemu. Walisindikiziti kwa mliru gwa balagumu na mapenka na matowazi na maziwu makulu ga vinanda na vinubi.<verse eid="1CH 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu paliweriti lyakwingira kumji gwa Dawudi, Mikali, mhinga gwa Sauli, kasunguliriti kulawa palidilisha lyakuyi, kamwona mfalumi Dawudi pakavina na kunemelera, su kamzarawiti mumoyu mwakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />Walijega Lisandiku lya Mlungu na kulitula mngati muliringu lyakanyawiti Dawudi. Shakapanu walaviya tambiku za kulunguziwa na za ponga kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Dawudi pakamaliliti kala kulaviya tambiku azi, kawatekeleriti wantu mulitawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />na kuwabagulira Waisraeli woseri, wapalu kwa wadala na kila yumu kapananwa libumunda, shipandi sha shinofu na libumunda lya zabibu.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />Dawudi kawasyaguliti Walawi wamonga su walitenderi Lisanduku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, wamkwisi na wamgambiri maya ga shii na wamzyumi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Kamsaguliti Asafu kuwera mkulu gwawu pakatangwa na Zekaria na Yeieli na Shemiramoti na Yehieli na Matitia na Eliyabu na Benaya na Obedi Edomu na Yeieli. Kawasyaguliti waweri wagomba vinanda na vinubi. Na Asafu kagombiti matowazi, <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />Watambika Benaniya na Yehazieli, wasyagulitwi pawagomba lipenka magenda kulongolu kwa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu lya Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />Lishaka ali Dawudi shintu sha kwanja shakatenditi ndo kumpanana Asafu na walongu wakuyi Walawi lihengu la kumwimbira Mtuwa Mlungu nyimbu za kumgambira maya gashii.<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa zyuma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Zabuli 105:1-15</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96:1-13</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 106:47">47</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 106:48">48</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />Mlongi maya gashii Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">mbweri ukulu wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">muwamaniziyi wantu mirandu yakayitenditi.<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Mumunemeleri na mumwimbili yomberi ukwisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:9">muwatambili matendu gakuyi ga kulikangasha gakatenditi!<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Mulikwisi litawu lyakuyi linanagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:10">yawamumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu na wasekeleri.<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />Mumusakuli Mtuwa Mlungu na makakala gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:11">mumuguwiri yomberi mashaka goseri.<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12" />Muliholi matendu gakuyi makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12">mawuzawuza gakuyi na toza zyakalaviyiti,<verse eid="1CH 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13" />Mwee wiwuka wa Israeli ntumintumi gwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:13">Mwenga wiwuka wa Yakobu, wasyagulwa wakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />Yomberi Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:14">toza zakuyi ziwoneka pasipanu poseri.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Muliholi lipatanu lyakuyi mashaka goseri mpaka mpeleru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:15">katenda shakatakuliti kwa viyiwuku elufu. <verse eid="1CH 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />Lipatanu lyakalitenditi na Abrahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:16">na lyakatenditi Isaka. <verse eid="1CH 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi lipatanu na Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:17">lipatanu kwa Israeli lyanalilika mashaka goseri mpaka mpeleru. <verse eid="1CH 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />Kalonga, hanikupanani isi ya Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">Na yeni hayiweri yenu maweni.<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />Walanga yenu iweriti ndidini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:19">muweriti wadidini na wahenga muisi ya Kanaani,<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />pamuyerayera kulawa isi yimu mpaka isi yimonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:20">kulawa ufalumi wumu mpaka ufalumi umonga.<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />Mlungu kajimiriti ndiri muntu yoseri kawawoneri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:21">kwa kuwalolera kawakalapiriti wafalumi woseri.<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />Pakalonga, namjera kuwashinkula wasyagula waneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:22">namuwatenda wambuyi waneni!<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Mumwimbiri Mtuwa Mlungu, pasipanu poseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:23">Mubweri kila lishaka matendu gakuyi ga ulopuziya<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Mgabweleri maisi uweru wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:24">muwagambiri wantu woseri mirandu yakuyi ya kulikangasha.<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu ndo mkulu, kazyumwa nentu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:25">kafiruwa kupananwa ligoya kuliku wamlungu woseri.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />Toziya wamlungu woseri wa wantu ndo shinyagu hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:26">kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kanyawiti kumpindi.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />Uweru na zyuma vimzengeta yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:27">makakala na nemeru vimemiziya numba nkulu yakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Mmupanani Mtuwa Mlungu, ligoya mwenga wantu woseri wa pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:28">yina, muubweri uweru na makakala gakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Mumpanani Mtuwa Mlungu ligoya na uweru wa litawu lyakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">Mjegi tambiku na kwingira Munumba mwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">Mmuguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu pahala pakuyi pananagala,<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />mwee wantu woseri mlendemeri kulongolu kwakuyi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:30">Kapatula gangamala pasipanu, hapapawezi kutikinyika.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />Mnemeleri mwe mpindi na pasipanu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:31">Muwagambiri wantu woseri, Mtuwa Mlungu kakolamlima!<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />Bahari na ivumi, pamuhera na vyoseri vyaviwera amu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:32">Mnemeleri mwe malambu na vyoseri vyaviwera amu!<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />Mwee mitera yoseri ya muntundu mumzyumi kwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">nemeru kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">yina, yakiza kupatoza pasipanu.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />Mumgambili mayagashi Mtuwa Mlungu yomberi ndo mheri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:34">toziya ufiru wakuyi ulikala mashaka goseri.<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />Mmugambiri Mtuwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">Gutulopuziyi, gwee Mlungu mlopuziya gwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">gutujojoniri pamuhera na kutulopola kulawa kwa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">su tupati kulikwisa litawa lyaku linanagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">na tulizyumi mu zyuma zaku.<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />Kakwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:36">mashaka goseri mpaka mpeleru!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">Shakapanu wantu woseri walongi, “Yina haa!” Viraa wamzyuma Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guwira aku Yerusalemu na Gibiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />Mfalumi Dawudi kawaweka Asafu na walongu wakuyi Walawi pahala pawalituliti lisanduku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya ya tendera yazifiluwa kulongolu kulisanduku kila lishaka. <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />Obedi Edomu mwana gwa Yedutuni pamuhera na wayaguyi sitini na wanani wawatangi. Obedi Edomu mwana gwa Yedutuni na Hosa waweriti walolera wa magomi. <verse eid="1CH 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Viraa kawatuliti Sadoki mtambika na watambika wayaguyi kutenda lihengu kulongolu kulilingu lya Mtuwa Mlungu lyaliweriti pahala pa kuguwira aku Gibiyoni. <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />Su kumvilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziwa pampindi pa shitalawanda sha tambiku za kulunguziwa mashaka goseri mandawira na pamihi, kulinganira na goseri yagalembitwi mulagiru ya Mtuwa Mlungu yakawagambiriti Waisraeli. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Pamuhera na womberi waweriti Hemani na Yedutuni na woseri walii yawasyagulitwi, su kulonga mayagashi Mtuwa Mlungu kwa ufiru waku ndo wa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Hemani na Yedutuni waweriti wagolokera wa lipenka na matowazi kwajili ya muziki na vyombu vyose vya muziki kwajili nyimbu nanagala. Lukolu lwa Yedutuni wasyagulitwi kugalolera magomi. <verse eid="1CH 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" />Shakapanu, kila muntu kawukiti kugenda ukaya kwakuyi na Dawudi kagenda ukaya na kuyitekelera kaya yakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Ulagilagi wa Natani kwa Dawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Samweli 7:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />Shaka mfalumi Dawudi pakaweriti kalikala kuliboma, lishaka limu kamshemiti mbuyi gwa Mlungu Natani na kumgambira, “Guloli, neni nilikala kunumba iherepa yayinyawitwi kwa mielezi, kumbiti lisandiku la lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu lilikala kuliringu.” <verse eid="1CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Natani kamgambira Dawudi, “Gutendi shoseri shaguholera mumoyu mwaku, toziya Mlungu kapamuhera na gwenga.” <verse eid="1CH 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />Kumbiti pashiru palaapalii shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shimwizira Natani, kulonga, <verse eid="1CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />“Gugendi gwakamgambili ntumintumi gwangu Dawudi, Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Gwenga hapeni gunyawiri numba ya kulikala. <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />Kwanjira shaka shilii paniwakomboliti wantu wa Israeli kulawa Misri mpaka leru, hanenilikali kunumba. Liweriti lyankuwuka kulawa pahala pamu kugenda pahala pamonga na kulawa makawu mpaka makawu gamonga.” <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />Hashi, kila pahala pang'enditi na Waisraeli, nimkosiya mkulu gwawu yoseri yanimgambiriti kawaloleri wantu wa neni, “Kwa shishi munyawira ndiri numba ya mierezi?”<verse eid="1CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />“Hangu su, mmugambiri ntumintumi gwangu Dawudi, Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala kalonga hangu, nikuwusiyiti kumaliwuziwu paguweriti gwankuwalolera kondolu, Su guweri mkulu gwa wantu waneni Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />Kwanjira shaka ashi nweriti pamuhera na gwenga poseri pagugenditi na kuwakanka wankondu waku woseri kulongolu kwaku. Hanikutendi guweri gumaniki handa wakulu wamonga wa pasipanu. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9" />Neni haniwasyaguliri wantu wangu wa Israeli pahala pa kulikala niwayoshikeri, su wakali pahala pawu weni, nawatabisiwa kayi. Na wantu wangesera yawatendera makakala hapeni wawatabisiyi kayi handa pakwanja, tabisiwa kayi na wantu wadoda, gambira ntambu yawatenditi makashu, <verse eid="1CH 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10" />kwanjira mashaka paniwasyaguliti wakulu kwajiri ya wantu waneni Israeli, neni haniwakanki wankondu wawu woseri. Nentu ya goseri, neni Mtuwa Mlungu nikubwelera handa wiwuka waku hawaweri wafalumi. <verse eid="1CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />Mashaka ga kulikala kwaku pagapera na paguwera guhowa na gwenga haguweri pamuhera na wambuyi waku yawahowiti. Hanimtendi yumu gwa wana waku, gwenga gamweni kaweri mfalumi na neni haniugangamaziyi ufalumi wakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />Yomberi ndo hakanyawiri numba na neni haniwutendi ufalumi wakuyi uweri wa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" />Neni haweri tati gwakuyi na yomberi mwana gwa neni, hapeni mbusiyi ufiru wangu ntambu yambusiyiti kwa Sauli yakakulongoleriti. <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />Hanimtuli kakolimlima wantu wa neni Israeli na ufalumi waneni hawulikali mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="1CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Natani kamgambiriti Dawudi mirandu yoseri ayi kulinganira na malola goseri gakagubutulitwi na Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luwa ya Dawudi yakalonga mayagashi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2 Samweli 7:18-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Shakapanu Mfalumi Dawudi kingira Muliringu Linanagala na kulivaga kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, shakapanu kaluwa, “Neni na gaa, Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu na numba yangu ndo shishi ata gunkwisi ntambu ayi? <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />Aga hera, guntendera mavuwa nentu ata. Gung'ambiziya hagutendi kwa wiwuka wa neni wawiza gwee Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />Nikugambili shishi nentu, neni Dawudi ntumintumi gwaku, kwa kumkwisa hangu? Gwenga gumana na guntenda nweri na ligoya neni ntumintumi gwaku. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya ya ntumintumi gwaku na kwa nfiru yaku gamweni, gutenda shagulongiti shimaniki, su gamaniki matendu makulu goseri aga. <verse eid="1CH 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />Kwahera gwingi handa gwenga, Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu na gatupikinira galanguziya handa kwahera Mlungu gwingi ila gwenga. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Kayi ndo wantu gaa pasipanu womberi waweza kulandanaziwa na wantu waku Israeli weni gweka yawu Mlungu gwawu kagenditi kuwalopola su waweri wantu wakuyi? Gwenga gulitenderiti litawu kwa kutenda mirandu mikulu na ya kulikangasha panu paguwawingiti maisi kulongolu kwa wantu waku weni guwakombuliti kulawa Misri. <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" />Guwatenditi wantu waku mweni Israeli kuwera wantu waku mashaka Goseri na Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guwera Mlungu gwawu.”<verse eid="1CH 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />“Vinu su, Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gushigangamaziyi mashaka goseri shisoweru shaku shagulongiti kwa neni ntumintumi gwaku na kwa wiwuka wangu. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />Na litawu lyaku lizyumwi mashaka goseri na wantu hawalongi, Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala, ndo Mlungu gwa Israeli. Na kaya yangu, neni Dawudi ntumintumi gwaku, haguugangamaziyi ufalumi wakuyi kulongolu kwaku. <verse eid="1CH 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />Toziya gwee Mlungu gwangu guntenda kuwera ntira ndiri kukuluwa gwenga, gung'ubutulira pagulonga ukulu wa neni hawulikali. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Vinu gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gwenga ndo Mlungu, gung'ambira neni ntumintumi gwaku mlandu agu mheri. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />Hangu nikuluwa guwutekeleri wiwuka wangu, neni ntumintumi gwaku, su ulonguziya ulikali mashaka goseri kulongolu kwaku, toziya shagutekelera gwenga, shiwera shitekelerwa mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Ukanka wa mashonta ga Dawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">2 Samweli 8:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Pa aga, mfalumi Dawudi kawakankiti Wafiristi na kugutola muji gwa Gati pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi vyaviweriti vya Wafilisti. <verse eid="1CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />Viraa Dawudi kawakankiti Wamowabu, wanja kukolwamlima na yomberi na wawera wankumlipa kodi. <verse eid="1CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />Shakapanu Dawudi kamkankiti Hadadezeri mfalumi gwa Soba, isi iweriti pakwegera na mbaka ya Hamati, katenditi hangu shaka pakagenditi kuligolusilira lupanda lwa kulihola pahala pa lushemba Eufrati. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />Dawudi kalopoliti mbutuka za kukwegwa na farasi elufu yimu, mashonta wakwena farasi elufu saba na mashonta yawagenda kwa magulu elufu ishilini. Shakapanu Dawudi kadumula mishipa ya magulu ga kumbeli ga farasi woseri wa mbutuka za kukwega na farasi, ila kawasigaziya miya yimu. <verse eid="1CH 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Waaramu wa Dameski, pawagenditi kumtanga mfalumi Hadadezeri gwa Soba, Dawudi kawakomangiti na kuwalaga wantu elufu ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Shakapanu Dawudi kawatula mung'onjeru za wamashonta mumji gwa Shamu ya Dameski. Na Waaramu wanja kukolwamlima na wawera wankulipa kodi. Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana Dawudi ukanka koseri kwakagenditi. <verse eid="1CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />Dawudi katoliti shinga za zahabu zyawajegiti wamashonta wakulu wa Hadadezeri na kazijega Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" />Katoliti viraa shaba ivuwa nentu kulawa mji gwa Tibati na mji gwa Kuni, yayiweriti miji ya Hadadezeri. Shakapanu Selemani kayitenderiti shaba ayi kunyawira beseni na mpanda na vyombu vya shaba.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9" />Shaka Towu, mfalumi gwa Hamati pakapikaniriti handa Dawudi kalikanka shonta lyoseri lya Hadadezeri mfalumi gwa Soba, <verse eid="1CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10" />kamtumiti mwana gwakuyi Hadoramu kwa mfalumi Dawudi, su kumlamsiya na kumzyuma toziya kaweriti kalikomanga na Hadadezeri na kumkanka. Toziya Hadadizeri kalikomangiti na Towu mala zivuwa. Hadoramu kamjegeriti Dawudi lifupu lwa vyombu vya feza, zahabu na shaba. <verse eid="1CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Mafupu aga, mfalumi Dawudi kagalaviyi toziya mahengu gwekagweka kwa Mtuwa Mlungu pamuhera na feza na zahabu vyakavilopoliti kulawa maisi goseri. Edomu na Mowabu na Amoni na Wafiristi na Amaleki.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Abishai mwana gwa Seruya, kawalagiti wantu wa Edomu elufu lilongu na msheshi mululalanda lwa Munu. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />Kanyawiti ngonjeru za mashonta aku Edomu. Na Wantu wa Edomu woseri wakolitimlima na Dawudi. Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti Dawudi ukanka koseri kwakagenditi.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />Dawudi kakolitimlima mu Israeli yoseri pakatenda kuwera na nakaka handa wantu wakuyi woseri hawatenderwi shilii shashiwera shiheri na teratera. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Yoabu mwana gwa Seruya kaweriti mkulu gwa mashonta, Yehoshafati mwana gwa Ahiludi kaweriti mtula maholu, <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />Sadoki, mwana gwa Ahitubu na Ahimeleki, mwana gwa Abiyatali waweriti watambika, Shawusha kaweriti mlemba yagalawira, <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada kagolokeriti walolera wakuyi mweni Dawudi Wakereti na Wapeleti, wana gwa Dawudi waweriti walonguziya wakulu muukolamlima wakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuwankanka Waamoni na Waaramu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">2 Samweli 10:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />Pa aga, Nahashi mfalumi gwa Waamoni kahowiti na Hanuni mwana gwakuyi kawera mfalumi pa yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />Su, Dawudi kalonga, “Hanimtenderi maheri Hanuni mwana gwa Nahashi, toziya tati gwakuyi kantendiriti maheri viraa.” Hangu Dawudi katumiti walagilagi kumjegera visoweru vya kumkolamawoku kwajili ya kuhowa kwa tati gwakuyi. Na womberi wagenda kwa Hanuni su kumkolamawoku aku muisi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />Kumbiti wakulu wa Waamoni wamgambira mfalumi Hanuni, “Hashi! Gulihola ndo toziya ya ligoya lya tati gwaku Dawudi kawalagalira walagilagi awa wizi kukukolamawoku? Wantu awa wankondu ndiri yawalagaliritwi kwiza kuyilolalola isi na kuyagamiziya?”<verse eid="1CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Hangu Hanuni kawatola walagilagi awa wa Dawudi, kawamoga ndevu na kuzipapula nguwu zawu pakati mpaka pasi pakukalira, shakapanu kawalaviya wagendi zawu. <verse eid="1CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Womberi wawuka kuwuya ukaya. Dawudi pakagambiritwi visoweru ntambu yawatenderitwi walagilagi wakuyi, kalagalira wantu kuwawanka toziya walagilagi awa wawoniti soni nentu. Na mfalumi kawagambiriti, “Mlikali kumji Yeriku, mpaka pamumera ndevu, Shakapanu muwuyi.”<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Waamoni pawawoniti walitenda wakalaziwi na Dawudi, Hanuni na Waamoni walagaliriti wantu wajegi mabuwi ga kilu elufu selasini na msheshi za feza kukodi mbutuka za wakwena farasi kulawa Misopotamiya na Aramaaka na Soba. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Wakodishiti mbutuka za kukwega na farasi elufu selasini na mbili na mfalumi gwa Maaka na mashonta wakuyi, kiza na kunyawa ngonjeru pakwegera na Medeba. Waamoni walijojonira kulawa kumiji yawu yoseri, walitanda kala kwa nkondu.<verse eid="1CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Na Dawudi pakapikaniriti visoweru avi, kamlagaliriti Yoabu na lishonta lyoseri lya makambaku. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Waamoni walawa na kulitula kala kuligomi lyawu lya mji, viraa wafalumi yawiziti waweriti gwekayawu kululalanda.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Yoabu pakawoniti handa nkondu ndo ikalipa kwa yomberi, kulongolu na kumbeli, kasyagula wamu wa mashonta wagangamala nentu wa Waisraeli, su walikomangi na Waaramu. <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />Wamashonta wamonga wali yawasigaliti, kawatula muulolera wa ulongoziya wa Abishai mlongu gwakuyi, na yomberi kawatula su walikomangi na Waamoni. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />Yoabu kamgambira Abishai, “Payiwera Waaramu wana makakala nentu, haguntangi, kumbiti handa Waamoni wana makakala nentu, hanizi kukutanga. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />Guweri mgangamala! Tulikomangi shipalu toziya ya wantu wetu na miji ya Mlungu gwetu na Mtuwa Mlungu katutenderi lyakaliwona liheri kwakuyi.”<verse eid="1CH 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Shakapanu Yoabu na wantu wakuyi wendereya kulikomanga na Waaramu na womberi watiriti. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Waamoni pawawoniti Waaramu watuga na womberi wamtiriti Abishai, mlongu gwa Yoabu na kwingira kumji. Shakapanu Yoabu kawuya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Na Waaramu pawaliwoniti handa wasinda na Waisraeli, walagalira walagilagi wagendi kuwajega Waaramu wamonga yawaweriti kumwambu kulushemba Eufrati, pawalongoziwa na Shofaki, mkulu gwa lishonta lya Hadadezeri. <verse eid="1CH 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Dawudi pakagambiritwi aga, kawajojoneriti pamuhera wantu wa Israeli woseri na kaloka lushemba Yoridani, kawagendera na kupanga vipinga vyakuyi kwa womberi. Dawudi pakapangiti nkondu kwa Waaramu su na womberi walikomangiti na yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Kumbiti Waaramu wawatiriti Waisraeli na Dawudi kawalagiti Waalamu elufu saba yawendesha mbutuka za kukwegwa na farasi na wanjagira wa magulu elufu alubayini. Viraa kamlagiti Shofaki mkulu gwa lishonta lyawu. <verse eid="1CH 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Shakapanu wafalumi wa Hadadezeri pawawoniti kuwera wantu wa Israeli wawakanka, watenditi lipatanu lya ponga na Dawudi na womberi wawera wantumintumi wa Dawudi. Hangu Waaramu wajimiriti ndiri kuwatanga Waamoni kayi.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankugutola mji gwa Raba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">2 Samweli 12:26-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />Pakwanja pa shinja sha syayi shawu, shaka wafalumi kugenda kunkondu, Yoabu kalongoziyiti lishonta na kulopola isi ya Waamoni, viraa kagenda kuguzyengeta na kagukomangiti na kuguhalibisiya Raba. Kumbiti Dawudi kasigaliti aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" />Yomberi Dawudi katoliti lijenjeri lya mlungu gwawu Milikomu pamtuwi pakuyi na lijenjeri ali liweriti na utopa wa kilu selasini na msheshi za zahabu na mngati mwakuyi muweriti na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu. Na Dawudi kalitoliti kaherepiziya lijenjeri lyakuyi. Viraa katoliti kwa makakala vintu vivuwa kulawa mumji agu. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />Shakapanu kawatoliti wantu yawaweriti amu, watendi lihengu kwa misumenu, sululu za shuma na mawagu. Hangu ndo ntambu yakatenditi miji yoseri ya Waamoni. Shakapanu Dawudi na wantu woseri wawuya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondu na makambaku ga Shifiristi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 21:15-22">2 Samweli 21:15-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />Shakapanu kulawiriti nkondu na Wafiristi aku Gezeri. Sibekai kulawa Hushati kamlagiti Sipai, yakaweriti yumu gwa wiwuka wa Warefai yawaweriti makambaku na Wafiristi wasinditi.<verse eid="1CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" />Kulawiriti kayi nkondu imonga na Wafiristi, Elihanani mwana gwa Yairi kamlagiti Lahimi mlongu gwakuyi Goliyati kulawa Giti, mweni mhanya gwa mgowa gwakuyi, guweriti mkulu handa gwa mtera gwa kufumira.<verse eid="1CH 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Shakapanu kulawiriti nkondu yimonga kayi aku Gati kweni kuweriti na muntu yumu kaweriti na nshimba nkulu na vyala sita kila liwoku na vyala sita kila ligulu, walanga yakuyi ya vyala iweriti ishilini na msheshi. Yomberi viraa kaweriti mwiwuka gwa makambaku. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />Yomberi pakawigiriti Waisraeli, Yonatani mwana gwa Shimea, mlongu gwa Dawudi, kamlagiti.<verse eid="1CH 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />Makambaku awa watatu yawalagitwi na Dawudi na wamashonta wakuyi waweriti wiwuka wa makambaku aku Gati.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuwawalanga Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2 Samweli 24:1-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />Shetani kafiliti kawajegeri ntabiku wa Israeli, kamzyangazyanga Dawudi kawawalangi wantu. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Hangu Dawudi kamlagalira Yoabu na wakulu wa lishonta wamonga, “Mgendi mkawawalangi Waisraeli, kwanjira Beeri Sheba mpaka Dani. Munjegeri visoweru su nivimani walanga yawu.” <verse eid="1CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Kumbiti Yoabu kankula, “Mtuwa Mlungu na kawawongeri Waisraeli mala miya kuliku ntambu yawawera vinu! Mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, woseri awa ndo wantumintumi waku ndiri? Hashi su gufira kutenda mlandu agu gweni haguwatendi Waisraeli waweri mulikosa?” <verse eid="1CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Kumbiti shisoweru sha mfalumi shimtenda Yoabu kajimiri, hangu, kagenda muisi yoseri ya Israeli na shakapanu kawuya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />Yoabu kamjegeriti mfalumi Dawudi walanga ya wantu. Muisraeli yoseri, kuweriti wapalu miliyoni yimu na laki yimu yawavimana kutendera ligumba na Mu isi ya Yuda kuweriti wantu laki msheshi na elufu sabini. <verse eid="1CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" />Kumbiti Yoabu kawawalangiti ndiri Walawi na Wabenjamini, toziya kajimirianiti ndiri na lagira ya mfalumi.<verse eid="1CH 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />Mlungu kafiliziwa ndiri na mlandu agu hangu kayikomangiti Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />Shakapanu Dawudi kamgambira Mlungu, “Ntenda vidoda vikulu kwa shitendu ashi shantenditi! Kumbiti nikuluwa gundekiziyi neni ntumintumi gwaku, toziya ntenda mlandu gwa uzigizigi nakamu.”<verse eid="1CH 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kazumba na Gadi, mbuyi gwa Dawudi, kamgambira, <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />“Gugendi gwakamgambiri Dawudi handa neni Mtuwa Mlungu nimpanana mirandu mitatu. Kalisyaguliri gumu na neni hanimtenderi.” <verse eid="1CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Hangu Gadi kamgendera Dawudi na kumgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Gulisyaguliri gumu. <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" />Guweri na njala ya mivinja mitatu ama miyezi mitatu ya malaguwa kulawirana na wankondu waku na ligumba lya wankondu waku halikukanki ama mashaka matatu geni Mtuwa Mlungu hakawakomangi kwa ligumba lyakuyi, kupitira ntumintumi gwakuyi gwa kumpindi wajegeri malweri gakalipa muisi na ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwakuyi kapiti kuwagamiziya muisi yoseri ya Israeli. Vinu gwamuwi, ndo lyankulu gaa hanimpanani yomberi yakantumiti.”<verse eid="1CH 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />Dawudi kamwankula Gadi, “Moyu guntama na nahera shakutenda! Mbaka nkomangwi na Mtuwa Mlungu toziya yomberi kana lusungu nentu. Ila nakandeka nkomangwi na wantu.” <verse eid="1CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />Su, Mtuwa kawajegera Waisrali malweri makalipa, geni gajegiti kuhowa kwa Waisraeli sabini elufu. <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />Shakapanu Mlungu kamtumiti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwakuyi kagendi kuhalibisiya wantu wa Yerusalemu, Kumbiti pamberi hakenitendi hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu kagalambula nfiru yakuyi na kumgambira ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ayu yakatenditi ulaga awu, “Su, itosheya!” Shaka ashi ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kagolokiti pakwegera na luwaga lwa kukomera viboga lwa Orinani Myebusi.<verse eid="1CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />Dawudi kanyasuliti masu gakuyi na kumwona ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kagoloka pakati pa isi na kumpindi agawu katalipisiya ligumba lyakuyi su kuyitenda Yerusalemu. Shakapanu Dawudi na wazewi, yawaweriti wavala nguwu za mafafa waguwa makukama. <verse eid="1CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />Dawudi kamgambira Mlungu, “Hashi, ndo neni ndiri yandaviyiti litakulu la kuwawalanga wantu? Neni ndo yantenditi likosa na vidoda vikulu, kumbiti wantu awa handa kondolu yawahera vidoda watenda shishi? Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, su liwoku lyaku liweri kwa neni na wantu wangu, kumbiti naguleka malweri aga gendereyi kwa wantu waku.” <verse eid="1CH 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />Shakapanu ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamlagalila Gadi, kamgambiri Dawudi kagendi na kumnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu shitalawanda muluwaga lwa kukomangira viboga lwa Arawuna Myebusi. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Shakapanu Dawudi kajimira lilagiru lyakamgambiriti Gadi na kugenda handa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti. <verse eid="1CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Orunani pakagalambukiti na kumlola ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, ndo mweni na wana wakuyi wamsheshi yawawera pamuhera na walififiti. Na Orunani kaweriti kankukomanga nganu. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Shakapanu Dawudi kamsegelera Orunani na Orunani pakaloriti na kumwona Dawudi, Orunani kawukiti pa luwaga luliya lwa kukomangira viboga, kamsuntamira Dawudi makukama. <verse eid="1CH 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Dawudi kamgambira, “Gumpanani luwaga lwaku alu lwa kukomangira viboga su numnyawiri Mtuwa Mlungu Shitalawanda, su malweri makulu nagedereya kwa wantu, Guwuzili kwa beyi yayifiruwa.” <verse eid="1CH 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Na yomberi Orunani kamgambiriti Dawudi, “Gutoli luwaga alu. Mtuwa gwangu mfalumi gutendi shoseri shagushifira. Guloli, handaviyi wang'ombi yawaherepa toziya ya malaviwu ga kulunguziwa, vintu vya kukomangira viweri mbawu, pamuhera na nganu iweri tambiku lya viboga. Nankukupanana vyose avi.” <verse eid="1CH 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Kumbiti mfalumi Dawudi kamwankula Orunani, “Ndala! Ntakula kayi na kayi handipi beyi yayifiruwa. Hapeni ntoli shintu shaku toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu, sheni haneni shilipili.” <verse eid="1CH 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Su Dawudi kampananiti Orunani vipandi miya sita vya zahabu toziya ya luwaga luliya. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Shakapanu Dawudi kamnyawiliti Mtuwa Mlungu shitalawanda paliya na kumlavilira malaviwu ga kulunguziwa na malaviwu ga ponga. Kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi kamwankuliti maluwa gakuyi kwa kujega motu kulawa kumpindi, pampindi pa malaviwu ga kulunguziwa. <verse eid="1CH 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kayowera na Ntumintumi gwakuyi gwa kumpindi na yomberi kawuziya ligumba pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />Shaka ashi Dawudi pakawoniti handa Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula kuluwa kwakuyi kuluwaga lwa kukomangira viboga lwa Orunani Myebusi, su kalaviyiti malaviwu panu. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Shaka ashi aga pagalawiriti Numba nanagala ya Mtuwa Mlungu yeni Musa yakayinyawiti kushiwala aku pamuhera na shitalawanda sha malaviwu ga kulunguziwa kwa shaka ashi viweriti vyakali vya pahala pa pampindi pa kuguwira aku Gibiyoni. <verse eid="1CH 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Kumbiti Dawudi kasinditi kugenda aku Gibiyoni kumluwa Mlungu shakutenda, toziya katiriti ligumba lya ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Su Dawudi kalonga, “Panu ndo pahala numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu hayinyawiwi na viraa shitalawanda sheni wantu wa Israeli hawalaviliri tambiku ya kulunguziwa.”<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matandiru ga kunyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />Hangu Dawudi kalagalira wahenga yawalikala muisi ya Israeli wajojoniki na yomberi kawatuliti mulihengu. Kawatuliti wasongola mbawu wasongoli weri mabuwi ga kunyawira numba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />Dawudi kalaviyiti vyuma vivuwa vya kunyawira misumali na vitatiru vya kuwungira migomi ya numba na katulira shaba ivuwa yayiwalangika ndiri. <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />Viraa kalaviyiti magogu ya mielezi yayiwalangika ndiri, toziya Wasidoni na Watiru waweriti wamjegera Dawudi, walanga ivuwa ya mielezi. <verse eid="1CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Dawudi kalonga, “Numba yeni mwana gwangu Selemani yanakamnyawiri Mtuwa Mlungu hayiweri ya uherepa nentu na kuzyumika na wantu wa isi zoseri. Kumbiti toziya yomberi kankali mntemba na kazowelera ndiri, shondi nimtenderi matandiru.” Hangu su, Duwudi katulira vintu vivuwa nentu vya kunyawira pamberi hakeni howi. <verse eid="1CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Shakapanu Dawudi kamshemiti Mwana gwakuyi Selemani na kamlagalira kamyawiri numba nkulu Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" />Dawudi kamgambira Selemani, “Mwana gwangu, mumoyu mwangu nfiriti kumnyawira numba nkulu Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu su nimguwiri. <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, gwenga gwita mwazi guvuwa na kulikomanga nkondu ivuwa. Toziya ya mwazi guvuwa gwagwititi, hapeni gunyawiri numba. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Ata hangu, hagupati mwana, mweni hakakolimlima kwa ponga toziya hanimtendi kalikali kwa ponga na wankondu wakuyi woseri wa wapakwegera, Litawu lyakuyi hakaweri Selemani, toziya mumashaka ga ukolamlima wakuyi, hakayijegeri Israeli ponga na kunyamalira. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" />Yomberi hakanyawiri numba toziya ya kunguwira. Hakaweri mwana gwangu neni haweri tati gwakuyi na wiwuka wakuyi hawayikolimlima Israeli mashaka goseri. <verse eid="1CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />Vinu, mwana gwangu Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku na kaweri pamuhera na gwenga su guwezi kumnyawira numba ntambu yakalongiti. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakupanani luhala na umani shaka pakakupa ufalumi kuwalonguziya Israeli, gukoli malagiru ga Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" />Pagulilolera weri na kuzijimira lagiru zyeni Mtuwa Mlungu yakamlagalira Musa kuwapanana Waisraeli, hagufanikiwi. Nagutwezuka, guweri mgangamala. Nagutira pota kwinginika. <verse eid="1CH 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />Nkamalila nentu su kupata vintu toziya ya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, tani laki yimu za zahabu, tani milioni yimu za feza na walanga yayipimika ndiri ya shaba na shuma, zivuwa nentu. Ntanda kala mbawu na mabuwi. Kumbiti gufiruwa kongera. <verse eid="1CH 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15" />Gwana watenda lihengu wavuwa. Kwa wasongola mabuhi, wasongola mbawu na mafundi wa kila ntambu yawavimana kutenda lihengu, <verse eid="1CH 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16" />wa kuponda vintu zahabu na vintu vya feza na vintu vya shaba na vintu vya lyuma. Vinu gwanji mahengu! Na Mtuwa Mlungu na kaweri pamuhera na gwenga!”<verse eid="1CH 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />Shakapanu Dawudi kawalagalira wakulu woseri wa Waisraeli wamtangi Selemani mwana gwakuyi, pakalonga, <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />“Hashi, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu kapamuhera na mwenga ndiri? Hashi, hakeni wapanani ponga muwega zoseri? Yomberi kantenda niwakanki wantu woseri yawalikala isi ayi na vinu wakolamlimwa na mwenga pamtangwa na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Vinu, mmutenderi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, kwa nfiru na moyu goseri. Aya su! Mmunyawiri Mtuwa Mlungu pahala pananagala su lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu pamuhera na vyombu vyoseri vinanagala yavitenderwa mukuguwira, vituluwi mngati mwa vyumba vyamnyawiti toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />Dawudi pakaweriti mzewi gwa vinja vivuwa, kamtenditi mwana gwakuyi Selemani kawera mfalumi gwa Israeli.<verse eid="1CH 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />Mfalumi Dawudi kawashemeti wakulu woseri wa Israeli na watambika na Walawi. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />Kawawalangiti Walawi woseri wapalu yawanjira vinja selasini na kwendeleya, Walanga yawu waweriti selasini na nani elufu. <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4" />“Dawudi kawabaguga hangu. Ishilini na msheshi elufu pakati pawu watendi lihengu mu numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na elufu sita waweri wakulu na yawatula maholu, <verse eid="1CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5" />elufu msheshi waweri walolera wa magomi ga Mtuwa Mlungu na elufu msheshi pawamzyuma Mtuwa Mlungu kwa vyombu vya msambu vyakanyawiti mfalumi mweni toziya ya hangu.” <verse eid="1CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />Dawudi kawabagula Walawi muvipinga vitatu kulinganira na nkolu za likabila lya Lawi. Lukolu lwa Gerishoni na lukolu lwa Kohati na lukolu lwa Merari.<verse eid="1CH 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />Wana wa Gerishoni waweriti wawili. Ladani na Shimei. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8" />Ladani kaweriti na wana watatu: Yehieli mkulu gwawu na Zetamu na Yoeli. <verse eid="1CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9" />Wana wa Shimei waweriti watatu. Shelomoti, Hazaeli na Harani. Awa waweriti walonguziya wa lukolu lwa Ladani. <verse eid="1CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Wana wa Shimei waweriti walonguziya wamsheshi. Yahati na Ziza na Yeushi na Beria <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Yahati kaweriti mkulu gwawu, pakafatirwa na Ziza. Kumbiti Yeushi na Beria, toziya waweriti ndiri na wana wavuwa, wawalangitwi na lukolu lumu.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Wana wa Kohati waweriti wamsheshi. Amramu na Ishari na Hebroni na Uzieli. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" />Wana wa Amuramu waweriti. Aruni na Musa. Aruni na wiwuka wakuyi wasyagulitwi waweri pawatekelera vyombu vinanagala nentu, mashaka goseri watumiziyi ubani kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, pawamtendera na kuwatekelera wantu mulitawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu mashaka goseri. <verse eid="1CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Wana wa Musa, ntumintumi gwa Mlungu, wakantwa muwamu mwa likabila lya Lawi. <verse eid="1CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Wana wa Musa waweriti Gerishomu na Eliyezeri. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />Yakaweriti mkulu muwamu mwa wana wa Gerishoni ndo Shebueli. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Eliezeri kaweriti na mwana yumu hera, Rehabia na yomberi kaweriti mlonguziya. Kumbiti Rehabia kaweriti na wana wavuwa nentu. <verse eid="1CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />Ishari kamwuliti Shelomiti, mlonguziya gwa likabila lyoseri. <verse eid="1CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />Wana wa Hebroni waweriti wamsheshi. Gwa kwanja kaweriti Yeria, gwa pili Amaria, gwa tatu Yahazieli na gwa msheshi Yekameamu. <verse eid="1CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />Wana wa Uzieli waweriti wawili. Mika mkulu gwawu na Ishia gwa pili.<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Merari kaweriti na wana wawili. Mali na Mushi. Wana wa Mali waweriti wawili. Eleazari na kishi. <verse eid="1CH 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Eleazari kahowiti pota wana mpalu, ira wahinga hera. Wahinga awa wayugitwi na wipa wawu, wana wa Kishi. <verse eid="1CH 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Wana wa Mushi waweriti watatu. Mali, Ederi na Yeremoti. <verse eid="1CH 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />Walii yawaweriti wiwuka wa Lawi kulinganira na nkolu zawu na kaya zawu. Kila yumu gwawu yakafikiziyiti vinja ishilini ama nentu, kalembitwi litawu lyakuyi na kutenda mahengu muutenderu wa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />Dawudi kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli kawatenda waweri na ponga na yomberi hakalikali Yerusalemu mashaka goseri mpaka upeleru. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" />Hangu, Walawi hapawafiruwi kayi kulihamasiya liringu linanagala ama vyombu vyakuyi vya kuguwira.” <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Kulinganira na malagaliru ga mpeleru gakalaviyiti Dawudi, Walawi woseri yawasokiti vinja ishilini walembitwi kuutenderu wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" />Lihengu lyawu liweriti ndo: Kuwatanga watambika wa lukolu lwa Aruni muutenderu wa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, kutula weri ligeleri na vyumba, kuvigulula vyombu vinanagala vyoseri na kutenda mahengu ga utenderu wa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" />Pamuhera na aga, waweriti wankugolokera lihengu lya kutanda mabumunda mananagala, ubumu unama na tambiku ya viboga, mabumunda yagalekerwa ndiri simika, mabumunda yagayoshiyitwi kwa lipaki la mizeituni. Walawi awa ndo yanawapimi uzotopa na ukulu wa mabumunda aga ga tambiku. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30" />Kila lishaka mandawira na pashimii wafiriwitwi kugoloka kulongolu kwa Mlungu na kulonga mayagashi na kumzyuma, <verse eid="1CH 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31" />viravilii shaka sha mashaka ga koyera, mwezi kulawira na msambu, panu tambiku za kulunguziwa pazilaviwitwi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Lagiru zitulitwi kwa walanga ya Walawi yawalagaliritwi kutenda mahengu aga mashaka goseri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />Hangu, liweriti ndo lihengu lyawu kutula weri lilingu linanagala lya kuliwona na pahala pananagala na kuwatanga walongu wawu watambika, wiwuka wa Aruni, kuguwira munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga Watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Avi ndo vipinga vya wiwuka wa Aruni ntambu yawapangitwi. Aruni kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazari na Itamari. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" />Nadabu na Abihu wahowiti pamberi pa tati gwawu, waweriti ndiri na wana, kumbiti walongu wawu Eleyazari na Itamari wawera watambika. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />Dawudi pawatangwa na Sadoki mwana gwa Eleazari na Ahimeleki mwana gwa Itamari, Dawudi kawapangiti wiwuka wa Aruni, muvipinga kulawirana na mahengu gawu. <verse eid="1CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Walanga nkulu ya walonguziya waweriti muwamu mwa wiwuka wa Eleazari kuliku muwamu mwa wiwuka wa Itamali na womberi wabagulaniti hangu, walonguziya lilongu na sita kulawa wiwuka wa Eleazari na walonguziya wanani kulawa wiwuka wa Itamari. <verse eid="1CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" />Wabagulitwi kwa kugalambula simbi toziya muwamu mwawu kuweriti na wakulu yawatenda lihengu kunumba ya Mlungu na watambika mu nkolu zoseri mbili, mulukolu lwa Eleazari na lukolu lwa Itamari. <verse eid="1CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />Wiwuka wa Eleaza na Itamali waweriti wa kwanja kugalambula simbi. Shakapanu walembitwi matawu gawu na Shemaya mwana gwa Netaneli, mlemba yakaweriti Mlawi, kawalembiti matawu gawu kulongolu kwa mfalumi Dawudi, walonguziya wakuyi, mtambika sadoki, Ahimeleki mwana gwa Abiatari na walonguziya wa vipinga vya watambika na vya Walawi. Lukolu lwa Eleazari lupatiti simbi mbili na lukolu lwa Itamari simbi yimu. <verse eid="1CH 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Simbi yimu imtulukiliti Yoaribu ya pili Yedaya, <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />ya tatu Harimu na ya msheshi Seorimu, <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />ya mhanu Malikia na sita Miyamini, <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />ya saba Hakosi ya nani Abiya, <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />ya tisa Yeshuwa ya lilongu Shekaniya, <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />ya lilongu na moja Eliashibu na ya kumi na mbili Yakimu, <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />ya lilongu na tatu Hupa ya lilongu na msheshi Yeshebeabu, <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />ya lilongu na mhanu Biliga ya lilongu na sita Imeri, <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />ya lilongu na saba, Heziri ya lilongu na nane Hapisesi, <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />ya lilongu na tisa Petahiya na ya ishilini Yehezikeli, <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />ya ishilini na yimu Yakini ya ishilini na mbili Gamuli, <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />ya ishilini na tatu Delaya ya ishilini na msheshi Maazia.<verse eid="1CH 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" />Avi ndo vipinga vyavilembitwi kulinganira na mahengu gawu ga kwingira munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu kufata tenderu, ntambu yawatuliwitwi na Aruni tati gwawu, ntambu yakagambiritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walanga imonga ya Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20" />Awa ndo wiwuka wamonga wa Lawi. Yumu gwa wiwuka wa Amramu kaweriti Shubaeli na kulawa wiwuka wa Shubaeli kaweriti Yedeya. <verse eid="1CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21" />Yumu gwa wiwuka wa Rehabia kaweriti Ishio mlonguziya gwa lukolu. <verse eid="1CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />Kulawa kwa wiwuka wa Isari mlonguziya kaweriti Shelomiti, kulawa kwa wana wa Shelomiti mlonguziya kaweriti Yahati. <verse eid="1CH 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Wana wa Hebroni. Waweriti. Yeria gwa kwanja, Amaria gwa pili, Yahazieli gwa tatu, Yakameamu gwa msheshi. <verse eid="1CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24" />Mwana gwa Uzieli kaweriti Mika. Na mwana gwa Mika kaweriti Shamiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25" />Mlongu gwa Mika kaweriti Ishia na mwana gwa Ishia kaweriti Zekaria. <verse eid="1CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Wana wa Merari. Waweriti Mahili na Mushi. Na mwana gwa Yaazia kaweriti Benu. <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />Wana wa Merari kulawa kwa Yaazia ndo Benu na Shohamu na Zakuri na Ibiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28" />Kulawa kwa Mahili kaweriti Eleazari, yakaheriti wana. <verse eid="1CH 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29" />Kishi kaweriti na mwana yumu. Litawu lyakuyi Yerameeli. <verse eid="1CH 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Kulawa wiwuka wa Mushi waweriti wana watatu. Mahili na Ederi na Yeremoti. Awa waweriti wiwuka wa Lawi kulinganira na nkolu zawu. <verse eid="1CH 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" />Viraa woseri awa wagalambuliti simbi kulinganira na kaya ya kila mkulu na kila kaya ya mpusu gwakuyi, handa wiwuka wa Aruni ntambu yawatenditi. Wagalambuliti simbi kulongolu kwa Mfalumi Dawudi, Sadoki, Ahimeleki na walonguziya wa walongu wa watambika na wa Walawi.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Wimba munumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Dawudi pamuhera na wakulu wa mashonta, wawasyaguliti wamu wa wana wa Asafu na wana wa Hemani na wana wa Yedutuni, kulonguziya muutenderu wa kubwera shisoweru sha Mlungu kwa kutendera vinubi na vinanda na kayamba. Aga matawu ga wantu yawasyagulitwi kulonguziya guwira, pamuhera na lihengu lyalitenditwi na kila shipinga. <verse eid="1CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />Wana wamsheshi wa asafu. Zakuri na Yosefu na Netaniya na Asharela. Womberi waweriti pasi pa ulonguziya wa Asafu yakabweriti shisoweru sha Mlungu shaka shoseri sha ulonguziya wa mfalumi. <verse eid="1CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" />Wana sita wa Yedutuni waweriti. Gedaliya na Seri na Yeshaya na Shimei na Hashabiya na Matitiya. Womberi waweriti pasi pa ulonguziya wa tati gwawu na wabweriti shisoweru sha Mlungu kwa kutendera mazezi na walonga mayagashi na kumkwisa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1CH 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Wana wa Hemani waweriti lilongu na msheshi Bukia na Matania na Uzieli na Shebueli na Yeremoti na Hanania na Hanani na Eliata na Gidaliti na Romamti Ezeri na Yoshibekasha na Maloti na Hotiri na Mahazioti. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Mlungu kampananiti Hemani, yakaweriti mulola gwa mfalumi. Wana wapalu lilongu na msheshi na wadala watatu ntambu yakalongiti su kumkwisa. <verse eid="1CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Wana wakuyi wapalu woseri wagombiti msambu kwa kayamba, vinanda na mazezi, mukuguwira munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu pawawera pasi pa ulonguziya wa tati gwawu. Asafu na Yedutuni na Hemani waweriti pasi pa lagira ya mfalumi. <verse eid="1CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Walanga yawu pamuhera na walongu wawu Walawi yawafunditwi kumwimbira Mtuwa Mlungu, walanga yawu yoseri iweriti miya mbili semanini na nani. <verse eid="1CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />Woseri, wakulu kwa wadidini, wafunda kwa wafundwa, wagalambuliti simbi mkutula mahengu gawu. <verse eid="1CH 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9" />Simbi ya kwanja imtulukiliti Yosefu gwa walongu wa Asafu, simbi ya pili Gedalia pamuhera na wana wakuyi na walongu wakuyi lilongu na wawili, <verse eid="1CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10" />ya tatu imtulukira Zakuri na wana wakuyi na walongu wakuyi lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="1CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11" />Ya msheshi imtulukiliti Seri na wana wakuyi na walongu wakuyi lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="1CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12" />Ya mhanu imtulukiliti Netaniya na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13" />ya sita imtulukiliti Bukia na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14" />ya saba imtulukiliti Asharela na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15" />ya nani imtulukiliti Yeshaya na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16" />ya tisa imtulukiliti Matania na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17" />ya lilongu imtulukiliti Shimei na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18" />ya lilongu na yimu imtulukiliti Azareli na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19" />ya lilongu na mbili imtulukiliti Hashabia na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20" />ya lilongu na tatu imtulukiliti Shebueli na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21" />ya lilongu na msheshi imtulukiliti Matitiya na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22" />ya lilongu na mhanu imtulukiliti Yeremoti na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23" />ya lilongu na sita imtulukiliti Hanania na wana wakuyi lilongu mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24" />ya lilongu na saba imtulukiliti Yoshibekasha na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25" />ya lilongu na nani imtulukiliti Hanani na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26" />ya lilongu na tisa imtulukiliti Maloti na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27" />ya ishilini imtulukiliti Eliata, pamuhera na wana wakuyi lilongu mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28" />ya ishilini na yimu imtulukiliti Hotiri, pamuhera na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29" />ya ishilini na mbili imtulukiliti Gidaliti, pamuhera na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30" />ya ishilini na tatu imtulukiliti Mahazioti pamuhera na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="1CH 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31" />ya ishilini na msheshi imtulukiliti Romamti Ezeri, pamuhera na wana wakuyi lilongu na mbili na walongu wakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Walolera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Avi ndo vipinga vya Walawi yawatenditi mahengu ga ulolera magomi. Kulawa mulukolu lwa Kora, kaweriti Meshelemia mwana gwa Kore gwa kaya ya Asafu. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Meshelemia kaweriti na wana saba. Zekariya kaweriti mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja, Yediaeli gwa pili na Zebadia gwa tatu na Yatiniyeli gwa msheshi, <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />Eramu gwa mhanu, Yohanani gwa sita na Eliehoenia gwa saba.<verse eid="1CH 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4" />Viraa kuweriti na Obedi Edomu, mweni Mlungu kamtekeliriti kwa kumpanana wana wanani. Shemaya mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja, Yehozabadi gwa pili, Yowa gwa tatu, Sakari gwa msheshi, Netaneli gwa mhanu, <verse eid="1CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5" />Amieli gwa sita, Isakari gwa saba na Peuletai gwa nani. <verse eid="1CH 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Mwana gwakuyi shemaya kapatiti wana wapalu yawaweriti na ukulu mukaya ya tati gwawu, toziya waweriti wapalu wayapananitwi ligoya. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Wana wa Shemaya waweriti sita. Otini na Refaeli na Obedi na Elizabadi na Elihu na Semakia. Walongu wakuyi waweriti makambaku. <verse eid="1CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Woseri awa waweriti wana wa Obedi Edomu, pamuhera na wana wawu na walongu wawu, waweriti wantu wagangamala yawaweza kutenda lihengu. Wiwuka woseri wa Obedi Edomu waweriti sitini na wawili. <verse eid="1CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Meshelemia kaweriti na wana na walongu wakuyi, wantu wana uwezu wa lihengu ali lilongu na wanani. <verse eid="1CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />Hosa yumu gwawu gwa wana wa Merari kaweriti na wana wamsheshi. Shimiri yakatenditwi mlonguziya na tati gwakuyi tembera kawera ndiri shipanta njira, <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />Hilikiya gwa pili, Tebaliya gwa tatu na Zekariya gwa msheshi. Wana wapalu woseri wa Hosa pamuhera na walongu wakuyi waweriti lilongu na tatu.<verse eid="1CH 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />Walolera awa walibagula muvipinga kulinganira na walonguziya wawu na womberi viraa wapangiwitwi lihengu munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu handa Walawi wamonga. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />Kila kaya pota kulola uvuwa wawu, wagalambuliti simbi kwa kusyagula ligomi lyoshi hawaliloleri. <verse eid="1CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Simbi ya kusyagula kulolera ligomi likulu lya kwagulawira mshenji imtulukira Shelemia. Shakapanu imonga imtulukira Zekaria mwana gwakuyi, yakaweriti mgambiziya kana luhala, su kulolera ligomi likulu lya kushana. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Obedi Edomu katulukilitwi na simbi ya kulolera ligomi likulu lya Kusika na wana wakuyi mumahanja. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Shupimu na Hosa watulukilitwi na simbi ya kulolera ligomi likulu lya kwaguzyeta mshenji kuligomi likulu lya Shaleketi munjira yayiweriti uwega wa panani. Ulolera utenditwi kwa kugalambuziyana. <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Kila lishaka uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji kuweriti na walolera sita, kwaguzyeta mshenji walolera wamsheshi na kusika walolera wamsheshi, viraa kumahanja kutulitwi walolera wawiliwawili. <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />Mudamu guherepa guweriti uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji, kuweriti na walolera wamsheshi mnjira na walolera wawili kumdamu kweni. <verse eid="1CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Avi ndo vipinga vya walolera muwamu mwa lukolu lwa kora na Merari.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu gamonga munumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Muwamu mwa Walawi, Ahiya kaweriti na ulolera wa luhanja lwa numba ya Mlungu na luhanja lwa vintu vyavilumikitwi. <verse eid="1CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Kulawa kaya ya Ladani, lukolu lwa Gerishoni, Yehieli kaweriti mlonguziya gwawu.<verse eid="1CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Wana wa Yehieli, Zetamu na Yoeli, waweriti wagolokera wa luhanja lwa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Viravilii mahengu ga numba nkulu gabagulwa kwa wantu wa nkolu za Amramu na Waishari na Waheburoni na Wauzieli.<verse eid="1CH 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Shebueli, mwiwuka gwa Gerishoni na mwana gwa Musa kaweriti mlolera mkulu gwa hanja azi. <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Na mlongu gwakuyi, kaweriti Eliezeri yakaweriti tati gwakuyi Rehabia, mwana gwakuyi Yeshaya, mwana gwakuyi Yoramu mwana gwakuyi Zikiri mwana gwakuyi Shelomiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Shelomiti na walongu wakuyi, ndo yawaweriti walolera wa hanja zoseri za vintu vyavilumikitwi na mfalumi Dawudi na wakulu wa kaya na walonguziya wa maelufu na mamiya na wakulu wa mashonta. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Walumikiti seemu ya lopola zawalopoliti kunkondu kwajili ya manyawa ga numba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Viraa, vintu vyoseri vyavilumikitwi na Samueli mlola na vintu vyoseri vyavilukitwi na Sauli mwana gwa Kishi na vintu vyoseri vyavilumikitwi na Abineri mwana gwa Neri na vintu vyoseri vyavilumikitwi na Yoabu mwana gwa Seruya, viweriti pasi pa ulolera wa Shelomiti na walongu wakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu gamonga ga Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Muwamu mwa Waishari, Kenania na wana wakuyi wapananitwi mahengu ga ukolamlima, kuwera walonguziya wa wantu toziya ya Waisraeli.<verse eid="1CH 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Muwamu mwa Wahebuloni, Hashabiya na walongu wakuyi elufu yimu miya saba, wantu woseri yawapananwa ligoya wapananitwi mahengu ga kugolokera pahala pa Israeli yapaweriti uwega wa kwaguzyetera mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani. Wagolokiliti mahengu goseri ga Mtuwa Mlungu na mahengu ga mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Muwamu mwana Wehebuloni, Yeria kaweriti mkulu gwa nkolu na kaya yawu, na mushinja sha arubaini sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Dawudi, ulolalola utenditwi na wantu wana uwezu mkulu wapatikaniti aku Yezeri mu Gileyadi. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Mfalumi Dawudi kamsyaguliti Yeriya na walongu wakuyi elufu mbili miya saba, yawapananitwi ligoya na wakulu wa nkolu, kugolokera mirandu yoseri yamweni Mlungu na mfalumi Dawudi pahala pa Warubeni, Wagadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi, yawaweriti kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Mbagulanu gwa wamashonta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Ayi ndo walanga ya wakulu wa wiwuka wa Israeli yawaweriti wakulu wa kaya na wakulu wa mashonta wa maelufu na mamiya na wakulu wawu yawamtenderiti mfalumi Dawudi mumahengu ga kwingira na kulawa. Kila mwezi kila shinja, shipinga sha ntambu yingi sha wantu ishilini na msheshi elufu waweriti mukutenda mahengu.<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Yeshobeamu mwana gwa Zabidieli kaweriti mlonguziya gwa shipinga sha kwanja mumwezi gwa kwanja, shipinga shakuyi shiweriti na wantu elufu ishilini na msheshi. <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />Yomberi kaweriti mwiwuka gwa Peresi na yomberi kawera mkulu gwa wamashonta woseri wa shonta mumwezi gwa kwanja. <verse eid="1CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Mgolokera gwa shipinga sha pili kaweriti Dodai, kulawa likabila lya Hohi na Shipinga shakuyi shiweriti na wantu elufu ishilini na msheshi. Yakamtangiti kaweriti Mikiloti. <verse eid="1CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Mkulu gwa lishonta lya shipinga sha tatu pashiwera na wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi kaweriti Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, yakaweriti mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Ayu ndo Benaya yakaweriti shikambaku mushipinga sha wantu selasini na mlonguziya gwa shipinga ashi. Na Amizabadi mwana gwakuyi, kaweriti mkulu gwa lishonta. <verse eid="1CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Asaheli, mlongu gwa Yoabu, kaweriti gwa msheshi pakawalonguziya shipinga sha msheshi shana wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi na pa yomberi kamfatiti Zebadia mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Mu mwezi gwa mhanu. Kaweriti Shamhuti kulawa Izrahi, kaweriti na shipinga sha wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi. <verse eid="1CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Mu mwezi gwa sita. Ira, mwana gwa Ikeshi kulawa Tekoa, kaweriti na shipinga sha wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi. <verse eid="1CH 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Mu mwezi gwa saba. Helesi kulawa Peloni, gwa wana wa Efraimu, kaweriti na shipinga sha wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi. <verse eid="1CH 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Mwezi gwa nani. Sibekai kulawa Hushati, gwa Wazera, kaweriti na shipinga sha wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi. <verse eid="1CH 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Mwezi gwa tisa, kaweriti Abiyezeri kulawa Anatoti, gwa lukolu lwa Wabenjamini, kaweriti na shipinga sha wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi, <verse eid="1CH 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Mwezi gwa lilongu. Kaweriti Maharai kulawa Netofati gwa lukolu lwa Zera, kaweriti na shipinga sha wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi. <verse eid="1CH 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Mwezi gwa lilongu na gumu. Kaweriti Benaya kulawa Piratoni, gwa wana wa Efraimu na yomberi kaweriti na shipinga sha wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi. <verse eid="1CH 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Mumwezi gwa lilongu na mbili kaweriti Helidai kulawa Netofati, gwa Otinieli, viraa na yomberi kaweriti na shipinga sha wamashonta elufu ishilini na msheshi.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukolamlima wa makabira ga Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Wakulu yawaweriti wankulonguziya makabila ga Israeli waweriti. Kulawa kwa Warubeni. Eliezeri mwana gwa Zikiri, kulawa kwa Wasimiyoni, Shefatia mwana gwa Maaka, <verse eid="1CH 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />Kulawa kwa Walawi na Hashabia mwana gwa Kemueli Kulawa kwa Aruni na Sadoki, <verse eid="1CH 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />Kulawa kwa Yuda, Elihu, yumu gwa walongu wa mfalumi Dawudi, kulawa kwa Isakari, Omri mwana gwa Mikaeli, <verse eid="1CH 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />Kulawa kwa Wazabuluni. Ishimaya mwana gwa Obadia, Kulawa kwa Nafutali, Yeremoti mwana gwa Azirieli, <verse eid="1CH 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />Kulawa kwa Waefurahimu. Hoshea mwana gwa Azazia, kulawa nusu ya likabira lya Manasi, Yoeli mwana gwa Pedaya, <verse eid="1CH 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />Kulawa nusu ya likabira lya Manasi mugileyadi, Ido mwana gwa Zekariya, kulawa kwa Wabenjamini, Yaasieli mwana gwa Abineri, <verse eid="1CH 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />Kulawa kwa Dani, Azareli mwana gwa Yerohamu. Awa ndo wakulu wa makabila ga Israeli. <verse eid="1CH 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Kumbiti mfalumi Dawudi kawawalangiti ndiri wantu walii yawaweriti pasi pa vinja ishilini toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti hakawongeri Waisraeli waweri wavuwa handa ntondu za kumpindi. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Yoabu mwana gwa Seruya kanjiti kuwawalanga wantu kumbiti kawamalira ndiri, hangu maya ga Mlungu gawapatiti Waisraeli kwa shitendu ashi, su walanga ayi iyingiziwa ndiri mumaholu ga mfalumi Dawudi.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagolokera wa lunda za shifalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Yakagolokiliti hanja za mfalumi Dawudi kaweriti Azimaweti mwana gwa Adieli. Yonatani mwana gwa Uziya kagolokiriti hanja zimonga zyaziweriti kumalambu, kumjini, kuvijiji na kuliboma. <verse eid="1CH 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Yakagolokiliti malambu ga mfalumi kaweriti Eziri mwana gwa Kelubu. <verse eid="1CH 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Yakagolokiliti mahengu ga malambu ga mizabibu ga mfalumi kaweriti Shimei kulawa likabila lya Ramati. Yakagolokiliti kunyawa na kutula divayi kaweriti Zabudi kulawa likabila lya Shifimi. <verse eid="1CH 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Yakagolokiliti malambu ga mfalumi ga mizabibu na mikuyu mulalanda za vigongu vya kwaguzyeta mshenji, kaweriti Baali Hanani kulawa likabila lya Gederi. Yakagolokiliti hanja za lipaki lya mizeituni kaweriti Yowashi. <verse eid="1CH 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Yakagolokiliti vipinga vya ng'ombi wa mfalumi yawaweriti Sharoni kaweriti Shitirai, kulawa likabila lya Sharoni, yakagolokiliti vipinga vya wang'ombi wa mfalumi vyaviweriti kululalanda kaweriti Shafati mwana gwa Adilai. <verse eid="1CH 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Yakagolokiliti ngamiya wa mfalumi kaweriti Obili kulawa lukolu lwa Ishimaeli. Yakagolokiliti punda wa mfalumi kaweriti Yedeya kulawa lukolu lwa Meronoti. Yakagolokiliti vipinga vya wakondolu wa mfalumi kaweriti Yazizi kulawa lukolu lwa Hagiri. <verse eid="1CH 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Woseri awa waweriti walolera wa lunda za mfalumi Dawudi.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagambiziya wa mfalumi Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Yonatani, mjomba gwa mfalumi Dawudi, kaweriti mgambiziya na muntu yakana umani mkulu na mlemba. Yomberi na Yehieli mwana gwa Hakimoni waweriti wankuwafunda wana wa mfalumi. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Ahitofeli, kaweriti mgambiziya gwakuyi mfalumi, Hushai kulawa lukolu lwa Akiti kaweriti ganja gwa mfalumi. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Pakahowiti Ahitofeli, pahala pakuyi patolitwi na Yehoyada mwana gwa Benaya na Abiyatali. Yoabu kaweriti mkulu gwa lishonta lya mfalumi.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga Dawudi ga kunyawa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Mfalumi Dawudi kawashemiti aku Yerusalemu wakulu woseri wa Israeli. Wakulu wa makabila, wakulu wa mashonta na makambaku wa vipinga vyawamtenderiti mfalumi, wakulu wa mashonta maelufu, wakulu wa mashonta mamiya, wagolokera wa lunda zoseri na ng'ombi woseri wa mfalumi na wana wakuyi pamuhera na wakulu wa liboma, makambaku na wanjagira woseri wagangamala.<verse eid="1CH 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Shakapanu mfalumi Dawudi kagoloka na kulonga. “Mpikaniri walongu waneni na wantu wangu. Nfiriti mmoyu mwangu kunyawa numba ya kulitula lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu su tugendi kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu aku na neni ntanda kala vintu vyoseri vya kulinyawa. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Kumbiti Mlungu kandeweleriti, toziya neni ndo muntu gwa nkondu na kulaga wantu wavuwa. <verse eid="1CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli kasyaguliti neni muwamu mwa kaya ya tati gwangu kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli mashaka goseri mpaka mpeleru. Kalisyaguliti likabira lya Yuda kulonguziya na kulawirana na likabila ali, kayisyaguliti kaya ya tati gwangu na muwamu mwa wana wa tati gwangu, kafiliziwa na neni na kuntula weri mfalumi gwa Israeli yoseri. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana wana wavuwa na muwamu mwawu woseri awa, kamsyagula Selemani mwana gwangu kalikali pashiti sha ukulu sha ufalumi wakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu, kayikolimlima Israeli.”<verse eid="1CH 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, mwana gwaku Selemani ndo hakanyawili numba yangu na vimbambaza, toziya numsyagula yomberi kaweri mwana gwangu na neni haweri tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Haniugangamaziyi ufalumi wakuyi mashaka goseri payiwera hakendereyi kukola nakaka lagiru zyangu ntambu yakatenda leru.”<verse eid="1CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />“Vinu su, niwalagalira kulongolu kulijojoniku ali lya Waisraeli woseri shipinga sha wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu na kulongolu kwa Mlungu gwetu, mzibati lagiru zoseri za Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, su isi ayi iherepa yendeleyi kuwera yenu na kuwahalaziya wiwuka wenu pa mwenga mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />“Nagwenga Selemani mwana gwangu, gummani Mlungu gwa tati gwaku na gumtenderi kwa moyu gwaku goseri na kwa mahala gaku, toziya yomberi Mtuwa Mlungu kalolalola miyoyu na kuvimana galii gakafira kugatenda muntu. Pagumsakula yomberi, hagumuwoni, kumbiti pagumleka, hakakwasili kutali mashaka goseri. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />Su, gulikali weri na kulihola handa, Mtuwa Mlungu kakusyagula gwenga su gumnyawiri numba ya kuguwira. Guweri mgangamala gukatendi hangu.”<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Su Dawudi kampanana Selemani mwana gwakuyi mfanu gwa majengu goseri ga numba nkulu ya Mlungu, numba zakuyi, hanja zakuyi, golofa zakuyi, vyumba vyakuyi vya mngati na pahala pananagala nentu. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Kampananiti mfanu gwa numba ya Mlungu ntambu hayiweri handa rohu ntambu yakamlangaziyiti, kuusu ligeleri lya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na vyumba vya Mlungu na hanja za kutulira vintu vyavilumikitwi. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />Viraa kampananiti mfanu gwa ntambu ya kutenda toziya ya mibagulanu ya utenderu wa watambika na Walawi kutendera munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na kuvitula weri vyombu vyoseri vya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />Kampananiti zahabu yayifiruwitwi toziya ya kunyawira vyombu vyoseri vya zahabu vya untumintumi wa kila ntambu na kampananiti madini goseri ga feza gagafiruwitwi kwa utendera wa kila ntambu. <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />Utopa wa vintu vya kutulira vimiliku vya zahabu na vimiliku vyakuyi, utopa wa zahabu ya kila shintu shakutulira vimiliku na taa zakuyi na utopa wa madini ga feza ga kunyawira vintu na taa zakuyi kulinganira na matendera ga kila shintambi. <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />Zahabu ya kunyawira meza ya zahabu yayitulilitwi mabumunda yagalaviwitwi kwa Mlungu na feza ya kunyawira meza za madini ga feza, <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />viraa kalagaliriti zahabu ivuwa iherepa yayifiliwitwi kunyawira misomeru ya minofu, mabakuli na vikombi vikulu, viraa zahabu ivuwa na feza yayifiluwitwi kunyawira mabakuli ga zahabu na ga feza, <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />na zahabu iherepa ya kunyawira shitalawanda sha kutumiziya ubani. Viraa kampananiti mfanu gwa shigubikiru sha zahabu ya viwumbi vyana mpapatiru yawaziyalikiti na kuligibikira lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />“Mfalumi Dawudi kagatuliti lupalahera kwa malembu goseri aga gakapananitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. Su mahengu goseri gatendeki kulinganira na mfanu agu.”<verse eid="1CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Mfalumi Dawudi viraa kamgambira Selemani mwana gwakuyi, “Guweri mgangamala na moyu mkulu, Nagutira pota kuwera na lyoga. Mlungu, Mtuwa Mlungu mweni ndo Mlungu gwangu, ka pamuhera na gwenga. Hapeni kakuleki ila hakaweri na gwenga mpaka paliperaku lihengu lyoseri lyalifiruwa kutenderwa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Watambika na Walawi watulwa kala mumahengu gawafira kutenda munumba ya Mlungu. Kila muntu yakafira mweni na yakana umani wa kila ntambu hakaweri kala nakamu kukutanga na wantu woseri pamuhera na wakulu wawu hawaweri pasi pa lagalira yaku.”<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Malaviwu ga kunyawira numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />Mfalumi Dawudi kaligambiriti lijojoniku lyoseri lilii lyalisokiti, “Mwana gwangu Selemani, mweni gweka yakuyi kasyagulitwi na Mlungu, kankali mntemba na kahera uzowelera uvuwa na lihengu ali ndo likulu. Toziya numba yakayinyawa ya muntu ndiri, ila ndo ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Su, njonjonira vintukamalira nentu kwa uwezu wangu woseri kuyitulira numba ya Mlungu gwangu, Selemani kavifira toziya ya kunyawira numba nkulu ya Mlungu vyeni ndo shibigikiru sha zahabu, feza na shaba na shuma na mitera, mabuhi ga beyi nkulu, mabuhi ga kumemiziya vifungu, mabuhi yagashemwa njumu na langi gwekagweka na kila ntambu na malumalu. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Kayi, nentu ya vintu vyoseri vyandaviyiti toziya ya numba nanagala, ndaviya vintu vyangu namweni lya zahabu na feza na toziya niyifira numba ya Mlungu gwangu, ndaviya toziya ya numba ya Mlungu gwangu. <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />Tani miya lilongu na mhanu za zahabu kulawa ofiri, tani miya mbili sitini na mhanu za feza iherepa ya kumeremeriziya vibambaza vya numba nkulu, <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />na toziya ya vyombu vya zahabu na feza vyanavinyawiwi na mafundi. Ntula zahabu kwajili ya vyombu vya zahabu na feza kwajili ya vyombu vya feza. Ndo gaa su hakamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu leru?”<verse eid="1CH 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Shakapanu wakulu wa nkolu na walonguziya wa makabira ga Israeli na wakulu wa mashonta wa maelufu na wa mamiya, viraa na wakulu wagolokera wa mahengu ga mfalumi pawalaviyiti kwa kufira weni. <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />Walaviya toziya ya lihengu lya numba nkulu ya Mlungu. Tani miya yimu tisini za zahabu, tani miya tatu semanini za feza, tani miya sita sabini na mhanu za shaba na tani elufu tatu miya saba na hamsini za shuma. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Walii yawaweriti na mabuhi ga beyi nkulu wavilaviyiti vitulwi muluhanja lwa numba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, pasi pa ulolera wa Yehieli kulawa lukolu lwa Gerishoni. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Wantu wanemeleliti toziya walaviyiti kwa nfiru yawu weni na kwa moyu gwawu goseri wamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu na mfalumi Dawudi kanemeleriti nentu.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankumzyuma Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Dawudi ndo kamukwisa Mtuwa Mlungu kulongolu kwa lijojoniru lyoseri, pakalonga, “Gukwiswi mashaka goseri na mashaka goseri, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa mbuyi gwetu Yakobu. <verse eid="1CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" />Ukulu ndo waku, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gwana makakala, ukwisa, ukanka na uherepa. Vyoseri yaviwera kumpindi na pasipanu ndo vyaku. Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, ufalumi ndo waku na gwenga gukwiswa na gukolamlima panani pa vintu vyoseri. <verse eid="1CH 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Ulunda na ligoya vilawa kwa gwenga, vyoseri guvikolamlima. Uwezu na makakala vya mumawoku gaku na gwenga guwakulaziya wantu woseri na kuwagangamaziya woseri. <verse eid="1CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Vinu gwee Mlungu gwetu, tulonga mayagashii na kulizyuma litawu lyaku likulu.”<verse eid="1CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />“Kumbiti neni na gaa na wantu wangu ndo wagaa, ata tuwezi kukupanana vintu avi? Toziya Vintu vyoseri vilawa kwa gwenga, twenga tukulavilira vyaviwera vyaku gamweni. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Twenga twa wahenga kulongolu kwaku na wamwanja ntambu yawaweriti wambuyi wetu woseri. Mashaka getu pasipanu ndo handa shiviniru shashipita, panu kwahera litumbiru lya kulikala. <verse eid="1CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, uvuwa woseri awu watulaviyiti su kukunyawira numba toziya ya uweru wa litawu lyaku linanagala, ulawa mliwoku lyaku na goseri ndo gaku. <verse eid="1CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />Nivimana Mlungu gwangu, handa gwenga guyijera miyoyu ya wantu na gufiriziwa na uaminika wawu. Na neni, kwa waminika wangu ntaviya vintu avi vyoseri kwa kufira namweni na vinu mona wantu waku yawawera panu, pawakulavilira kwa kufira weni na nemeru. <verse eid="1CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu, wambuyi wetu, gwendeleyi kuwatenda su wendereyi kulilaviya kwa gwenga na gutuli nfiru ya miyoyu yawu iweri na waminika kwaku. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Gumpanani mwana gwangu Selemani su kakoli lagiru zaku kwa moyu goseri na matakulu na malagalira gaku, katendi goseri su kawezi kumalira kuyinyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu ayi yaniyitendiriti matandiru.”<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Shakapanu, mfalumi Dawudi kawagambiriti woseri yawajojonikiti, “Mmuzyumi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu.” Na woseri yawajojonikiti wamkwisa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu, wamsundamalira na kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu na kumlavilira mfalumi Dawudi ligoya. <verse eid="1CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />Lishaka lya pili wamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku za kulunguziwa. Ng'ombi shipalu elufu yimu, kondolu shipalu elufu yimu na kondolu wadikadika elufu yimu, pamuhera na tambiku zawu za kulanda na tambiku zivuwa kwajili ya Waisraeli woseri. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Lishaka ali su waliya na walanda kwa nemeleru nkulu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 29:22">Wamlumika Selemani mwana gwa Dawudi, mala ya pili. Wamwitira lipaki kaweri mkolamlima kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu na Sadoki kaweri mtambika. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Hangu Selemani kalivaga mu shiti sha ufalumi sha Mtuwa Mlungu kuweri mfalumi, pa Dawudi tati gwakuyi. Na yomberi katenditi weri muulonguziya wakuyi na isi yoseri ya Israeli imjimiriti. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Wakulu woseri na wamashonta na wana wapalu woseri wa Dawudi wajimiriti kuwera pasi pa mfalumi Selemani. <verse eid="1CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi Selemani kazyumwi kulongolu kwa Waisraeli woseri, kampanana ukulu wa shifalumi yawupita ukulu wa mfalumi yoseri yakakolitimlima Israeli pamberi pakuyi.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukolamlima wa Dawudi wankusoka kuupeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Dawudi, mwana gwa Yese, kaweriti mfalumi gwa Israeli yoseri. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />Kakolitimlima Israeli vinja alubayini, vinja saba kakolitimlima pakawera Hebroni na vinja selasini na mitatu kakolitimlima pakawera Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Kahowiti pakawera mzewi nentu, kalikala vinja vivuwa na lunda na ligoya. Na yomberi Selemani mwana gwakuyi, kakolamlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="1CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Visoweru vya mfalumi Dawudi kulawa kwanja mpaka upeleru, vilembitwi mumaholu ga mbuyi Samueli, mumaholu ga mbuyi Natani na mumaholu ga mbuyi Gadi. <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />Pamuhera na kukolamlima kwakuyi koseri na makakala gakuyi na mirandu yayimpatiti yomberi na isi ya Israeli na falumi zoseri za isi zapakwegera.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>